(886546, 101757, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Wonderful colors, and you certainly found interesting light here. with so much weight on the left with that tree, it may be worthwhile to try different angles to see what would happen if the tower were moved to the right. It might balance things just a tad better. Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely image. Wonderful colors, and you certainly found interesting light here. with so much weight on the left with that tree, it may be worthwhile to try different angles to see what would happen if the tower were moved to the right. It might balance things just a tad better. Nice work.', '2004-09-01 01:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
