(886656, 101520, 93, '<td valign="top">Is this out by Gold Coast, OR?  what a fantastic picture.. WOW.  A *little* weak on the framing idea, (it seems to me like it was a quick throw in) but it certainly does add something to the photograph. 7</td>', 'Is this out by Gold Coast, OR?  what a fantastic picture.. WOW.  A *little* weak on the framing idea, (it seems to me like it was a quick throw in) but it certainly does add something to the photograph. 7', '2004-09-01 01:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
