(886661, 101795, 10390, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t meet the challenge''s detail: "Capture an image where the foreground subject frames the rest of the image." There isn''t even a foreground subject there. Maybe you didn''t read the details, I''m sorry you didn''t.  This is a good photo with good bright colors (maybe you''ve overdone with saturation a little). It meets the challenge theme like you "explained" in the title, but not the detail, I think you''ll suffer for that.</td>', 'This doesn''t meet the challenge''s detail: "Capture an image where the foreground subject frames the rest of the image." There isn''t even a foreground subject there. Maybe you didn''t read the details, I''m sorry you didn''t.  This is a good photo with good bright colors (maybe you''ve overdone with saturation a little). It meets the challenge theme like you "explained" in the title, but not the detail, I think you''ll suffer for that.', '2004-09-01 01:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
