(886672, 101044, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I''m seeing it a *bit* to bright, but that could be a monitor difference thing.  I would have liked to have seen more of the lake too, by putting the camera up a couple of inches.</td>', 'Nice job.  I''m seeing it a *bit* to bright, but that could be a monitor difference thing.  I would have liked to have seen more of the lake too, by putting the camera up a couple of inches.', '2004-09-01 01:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
