(886738, 101454, 93, '<td valign="top">from experience, shooting into sunlight usually causes more dstraction than the effect you might have been looking for.  The flare here washes out the child''s face a little *too* much. I wonder if it might have been a better shot to do from a slightly better angle to avoid the flare.  Great idea, however.</td>', 'from experience, shooting into sunlight usually causes more dstraction than the effect you might have been looking for.  The flare here washes out the child''s face a little *too* much. I wonder if it might have been a better shot to do from a slightly better angle to avoid the flare.  Great idea, however.', '2004-09-01 02:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
