(886745, 101800, 93, '<td valign="top">great idea.  The large black borders aren''t my favorite, this would have benefitted from slimmer ones for sure.  You were probably going for the "Widescreen" effect though, so I''ll chalk it up to personal dislike.  The image itself is very nice. The harsh lighting actually works for me, and I think the creativity is top notch. 8</td>', 'great idea.  The large black borders aren''t my favorite, this would have benefitted from slimmer ones for sure.  You were probably going for the "Widescreen" effect though, so I''ll chalk it up to personal dislike.  The image itself is very nice. The harsh lighting actually works for me, and I think the creativity is top notch. 8', '2004-09-01 02:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
