(886751, 101939, 24704, '<td valign="top">Like both the color and lighting.  Good job.</td>', 'Like both the color and lighting.  Good job.', '2004-09-01 02:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(886752, 100852, 8816, '<td valign="top">I think this is an excellent photo, well composed and well thought out.  Except for one major detail!  In this type of photo, I think that the object your framing should be in focus.  Think about it, what is the point of a frame? To accent the subject contained within the frame, not to show off a nice frame.  This is excellent, but with a little more care it could be spectacular.  Nonetheless I''m still giving you a 10 cause i love it.</td>', 'I think this is an excellent photo, well composed and well thought out.  Except for one major detail!  In this type of photo, I think that the object your framing should be in focus.  Think about it, what is the point of a frame? To accent the subject contained within the frame, not to show off a nice frame.  This is excellent, but with a little more care it could be spectacular.  Nonetheless I''m still giving you a 10 cause i love it.', '2004-09-01 02:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(886753, 100369, 25183, '<td valign="top">Grandfather may be a little too dark, he is not part of the primary subject, but I think more light back there could have improved the image.  Also...a near merge with the utility pole behind grandpa.  I like the bright blue frames though...a fun one!</td>', 'Grandfather may be a little too dark, he is not part of the primary subject, but I think more light back there could have improved the image.  Also...a near merge with the utility pole behind grandpa.  I like the bright blue frames though...a fun one!', '2004-09-01 02:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
