(887207, 101282, 23478, '<td valign="top">This image works really well.</td>', 'This image works really well.', '2004-09-01 05:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(887208, 101385, 93, '<td valign="top">This shot is over-exposed. I''d suggest using an f-stop of about f5.6 and a shutter speed of 500 - 800.. and then experiment from there.. if you can.  If you have a p&amp;s, try aperture locking the sky, and the bringing the camera down to take the shot against the background of the trees.</td>', 'This shot is over-exposed. I''d suggest using an f-stop of about f5.6 and a shutter speed of 500 - 800.. and then experiment from there.. if you can.  If you have a p&s, try aperture locking the sky, and the bringing the camera down to take the shot against the background of the trees.', '2004-09-01 05:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(887209, 100662, 23560, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2004-09-01 05:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(887210, 101723, 23560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great shot.', '2004-09-01 05:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
