(887215, 100777, 93, '<td valign="top">extremely inventive. Is there a way you can get the second mug in a little more focus? That would have been interesting to see. Also, I suggest a cropping closer to the bottom of the mug handle and further from the top for centering purposes.</td>', 'extremely inventive. Is there a way you can get the second mug in a little more focus? That would have been interesting to see. Also, I suggest a cropping closer to the bottom of the mug handle and further from the top for centering purposes.', '2004-09-01 05:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
