(887537, 100723, 14656, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Technically, it could''ve been executed better. The photo seems to be muted and drab, lacking any real highlights (white) except for the tiny reflection in the eye. I would have liked to see more contrast in the image but 90% of this photo is midtone.</td>', 'Good idea. Technically, it could''ve been executed better. The photo seems to be muted and drab, lacking any real highlights (white) except for the tiny reflection in the eye. I would have liked to see more contrast in the image but 90% of this photo is midtone.', '2004-09-01 09:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(887542, 101805, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting to choose to photograph an uninteresting sport/game. The trees/houses in background is a bit of a distraction and I find that the image lacks a focal point. My eyes keep wandering between the man and the bowling balls but can''t decide what to look at.</td>', 'Interesting to choose to photograph an uninteresting sport/game. The trees/houses in background is a bit of a distraction and I find that the image lacks a focal point. My eyes keep wandering between the man and the bowling balls but can''t decide what to look at.', '2004-09-01 09:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(887545, 101843, 14656, '<td valign="top">Normally, I prefer the subjectmatter to be off-centered but I think it would help in this situation due to the diagonals formed by the building. Harsh lighting from the sky also hurts the image. I find the architecture much more interesting than the statue, thus my eyes never want to leave the foreground.</td>', 'Normally, I prefer the subjectmatter to be off-centered but I think it would help in this situation due to the diagonals formed by the building. Harsh lighting from the sky also hurts the image. I find the architecture much more interesting than the statue, thus my eyes never want to leave the foreground.', '2004-09-01 09:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(887549, 101850, 14656, '<td valign="top">A strange phenomena I notice occurring when snapping photos of tall buildings from below is from that angle and perspective, the buildings more often than not have the tendency to appear as if they are leaning and create and awkward sense of imbalance or falling.</td>', 'A strange phenomena I notice occurring when snapping photos of tall buildings from below is from that angle and perspective, the buildings more often than not have the tendency to appear as if they are leaning and create and awkward sense of imbalance or falling.', '2004-09-01 09:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(887552, 100418, 14656, '<td valign="top">It took a few moments for me to notice the crosses in the background being framed. Your image appears to be a lovely macro of the stone in the immediate foreground. Perhaps if the background was more brightly lit and the foreground was darker/in the shadows, more attention would be brought to the "framing." The OOF background and in focus foreground don''t help to accentuate the concept of "framing" either, but rather puts more focus on the "frame" itself.</td>', 'It took a few moments for me to notice the crosses in the background being framed. Your image appears to be a lovely macro of the stone in the immediate foreground. Perhaps if the background was more brightly lit and the foreground was darker/in the shadows, more attention would be brought to the "framing." The OOF background and in focus foreground don''t help to accentuate the concept of "framing" either, but rather puts more focus on the "frame" itself.', '2004-09-01 09:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(887555, 101820, 13759, '<td valign="top">BW don´t works well here! The green contranting with building will get more attention.</td>', 'BW don´t works well here! The green contranting with building will get more attention.', '2004-09-01 09:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(887557, 101826, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The blown out parts in his face are a little disturbing though, good luck :)</td>', 'Beautiful! The blown out parts in his face are a little disturbing though, good luck :)', '2004-09-01 09:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(887561, 101700, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very saturated colors, looks almost unnatural and borders on looking painterly. I think it works for this image. The building is what I naturally focus on and I''m not too sure if the trees hanging overhead help to frame your composition. If anything, I find myself trying to peek through the leaves to get a better view of the sky in which case everything below the horizon or on the ground would be unnecessary.</td>', 'Very saturated colors, looks almost unnatural and borders on looking painterly. I think it works for this image. The building is what I naturally focus on and I''m not too sure if the trees hanging overhead help to frame your composition. If anything, I find myself trying to peek through the leaves to get a better view of the sky in which case everything below the horizon or on the ground would be unnecessary.', '2004-09-01 10:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(887562, 101903, 25288, '<td valign="top">I like this one best, the foreground subject frames the background subject, the picture is funny and cute</td>', 'I like this one best, the foreground subject frames the background subject, the picture is funny and cute', '2004-09-01 10:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(887565, 101524, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting diagonal lines. Unfortunately as with many of the other entries, I find the foreground elements too distracting and competing for focus with the framed object.</td>', 'Interesting diagonal lines. Unfortunately as with many of the other entries, I find the foreground elements too distracting and competing for focus with the framed object.', '2004-09-01 10:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(887566, 100514, 13759, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but... this don´t apply to a framing technique.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but... this don´t apply to a framing technique.', '2004-09-01 10:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(887568, 101723, 14656, '<td valign="top">There is an almost voyeuristic feeling with this one. Background seems a tad overexposed but I''m wondering if detail would''ve been lost if the image were darker.</td>', 'There is an almost voyeuristic feeling with this one. Background seems a tad overexposed but I''m wondering if detail would''ve been lost if the image were darker.', '2004-09-01 10:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(887569, 101867, 25288, '<td valign="top">What is this? a paper towel tube?</td>', 'What is this? a paper towel tube?', '2004-09-01 10:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(887570, 101455, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Took me a few moments to catch onto this one. The toilet is a tad too blurry to make out immediately and thusly puts the viewers focus on the frame itself, rather than the intended framing.</td>', 'Nice macro. Took me a few moments to catch onto this one. The toilet is a tad too blurry to make out immediately and thusly puts the viewers focus on the frame itself, rather than the intended framing.', '2004-09-01 10:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(887573, 101468, 13759, '<td valign="top">The blue/magenta color casting in the subject suposes a huge post processing. I prefer the correct exposed frame.</td>', 'The blue/magenta color casting in the subject suposes a huge post processing. I prefer the correct exposed frame.', '2004-09-01 10:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(887574, 100719, 17245, '<td valign="top">Man, was this confusing or not ? I like it. I thought it was a mirror first but then I understood it was a glasswall with motives on it.</td>', 'Man, was this confusing or not ? I like it. I thought it was a mirror first but then I understood it was a glasswall with motives on it.', '2004-09-01 10:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(887575, 101916, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the model''s body seems contorted to fit the shape of the keyhole. The model seems a tad OOF and I''m not sure if the gray border works with this image.</td>', 'Interesting how the model''s body seems contorted to fit the shape of the keyhole. The model seems a tad OOF and I''m not sure if the gray border works with this image.', '2004-09-01 10:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(887577, 101495, 1368, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2004-09-01 10:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(887579, 101516, 14656, '<td valign="top">Appears as if this were a handheld shot as the lights blur in a vertical manner, characteristic of camera shake from depressing the shutter. A tripod would''ve been useful or laying the camera on a flat surface and using the timer. Also, a tighter crop around the moon would''ve helped to bring more attention to the subject. My eyes keep wandering to the right, being distracted by the red lights.</td>', 'Appears as if this were a handheld shot as the lights blur in a vertical manner, characteristic of camera shake from depressing the shutter. A tripod would''ve been useful or laying the camera on a flat surface and using the timer. Also, a tighter crop around the moon would''ve helped to bring more attention to the subject. My eyes keep wandering to the right, being distracted by the red lights.', '2004-09-01 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(887581, 101810, 14656, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the hand. I think it competes too much for attention and steals the focus away from the clouds.</td>', 'I like the lighting on the hand. I think it competes too much for attention and steals the focus away from the clouds.', '2004-09-01 10:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(887583, 101855, 14656, '<td valign="top">A tad overexposed and the highlights hurt my eyes. Nice composition but could''ve been technically executed better.</td>', 'A tad overexposed and the highlights hurt my eyes. Nice composition but could''ve been technically executed better.', '2004-09-01 10:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(887584, 101854, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice macro and I like the fisheye effect it has in the reflection. White background in upperleft and thing on top of globe a distraction.</td>', 'Nice macro and I like the fisheye effect it has in the reflection. White background in upperleft and thing on top of globe a distraction.', '2004-09-01 10:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(887586, 101796, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I find the ring on the thumb a distraction. Also the shadows on the ground and on 80% of the building hurt the image. Maybe shooting at a different time of day would''ve created better lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition. I find the ring on the thumb a distraction. Also the shadows on the ground and on 80% of the building hurt the image. Maybe shooting at a different time of day would''ve created better lighting.', '2004-09-01 10:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(887588, 101908, 18191, '<td valign="top">Your title is my Usernam so i feel entitled to comment. At first I did not see that there was a frame, and it is still not clear to me the purpose of the frame in the image. The lighting on your model''s face is very good, but the rest of the image is lost in underexposure so the frame does not show. The white spot on the right of the image is distracting also. Without the challenge in mind. A good portrait with the focus right on and good short lighting. Good job on that.</td>', 'Your title is my Usernam so i feel entitled to comment. At first I did not see that there was a frame, and it is still not clear to me the purpose of the frame in the image. The lighting on your model''s face is very good, but the rest of the image is lost in underexposure so the frame does not show. The white spot on the right of the image is distracting also. Without the challenge in mind. A good portrait with the focus right on and good short lighting. Good job on that.', '2004-09-01 10:17:20.000000', NULL, 1);
