(887759, 100550, 24778, '<td valign="top">this photo is too loaded with stuff... the frame should not contrain the user to see the framed object which I suppose it was the house that we barerly see. Nice lighting, anyway.</td>', 'this photo is too loaded with stuff... the frame should not contrain the user to see the framed object which I suppose it was the house that we barerly see. Nice lighting, anyway.', '2004-09-01 11:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(887769, 101813, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome idea and shot.  I think a bit closer cropping would have really made it though.  You could have cut out most of the overexposure at the top and the women''s face to the right which draws away from your subject and doesn''t add anything.  Great job.</td>', 'This is an awesome idea and shot.  I think a bit closer cropping would have really made it though.  You could have cut out most of the overexposure at the top and the women''s face to the right which draws away from your subject and doesn''t add anything.  Great job.', '2004-09-01 11:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(887774, 101952, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great job, one of this weeks best!!</td>', 'Great job, one of this weeks best!!', '2004-09-01 11:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(887775, 101855, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. The rims in the slide make the eyes follow back to the girl. The one curl of hair in her face is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the concept. The rims in the slide make the eyes follow back to the girl. The one curl of hair in her face is a bit distracting.', '2004-09-01 11:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
