(888101, 101282, 25459, '<td valign="top">Nice work, I like the frame you chose. It took me a second to figure out what was going on in the picture, but now I see. I wonder about the placement of the basketball though. It is where my eye fell, but I think the focus should be the subjects face.</td>', 'Nice work, I like the frame you chose. It took me a second to figure out what was going on in the picture, but now I see. I wonder about the placement of the basketball though. It is where my eye fell, but I think the focus should be the subjects face.', '2004-09-01 15:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
