(888112, 101908, 25459, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this photo, but I wonder if it is a bit too dark and mysterious to be tranquility. Also, the frame seems to be in the background. I like the lighting on the subjects face.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this photo, but I wonder if it is a bit too dark and mysterious to be tranquility. Also, the frame seems to be in the background. I like the lighting on the subjects face.', '2004-09-01 15:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
