(888117, 101629, 25330, '<td valign="top">A nice shot of the church.  Is it orthodox?  I would have liked to see a little more detail/saturation/brightness in the trees.  Maybe a longer exposure or a little lighting.</td>', 'A nice shot of the church.  Is it orthodox?  I would have liked to see a little more detail/saturation/brightness in the trees.  Maybe a longer exposure or a little lighting.', '2004-09-01 15:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
