(888121, 101699, 25459, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone, and the way the open door works with your title. I just love open doors in pictures. I wonder if the sunlight is a little intense though. I would be curious to know what this looked like in color.</td>', 'I like the sepia tone, and the way the open door works with your title. I just love open doors in pictures. I wonder if the sunlight is a little intense though. I would be curious to know what this looked like in color.', '2004-09-01 15:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
