(888537, 101860, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  and it actually fits the challenge as I understand it!</td>', 'Very nice!  and it actually fits the challenge as I understand it!', '2004-09-01 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(888541, 100600, 24065, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo -- the colors, lighting, composition, subject.  But it doesn''t meet the challenge guidelines as I understand them (I know there is some disagreement about the guidelines, but I''m trying to be fair and consistent.)</td>', 'I really like this photo -- the colors, lighting, composition, subject.  But it doesn''t meet the challenge guidelines as I understand them (I know there is some disagreement about the guidelines, but I''m trying to be fair and consistent.)', '2004-09-01 18:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(888546, 101275, 24065, '<td valign="top">This photo, at least to me, is a beautiful example of depth of field, or perspective, or landscape.  But as I understand the challenge, I can''t make it fit.  I know there''s some disagreement on that -- but I am trying to be fair and consistent.  I do like the photo, tho.</td>', 'This photo, at least to me, is a beautiful example of depth of field, or perspective, or landscape.  But as I understand the challenge, I can''t make it fit.  I know there''s some disagreement on that -- but I am trying to be fair and consistent.  I do like the photo, tho.', '2004-09-01 18:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(888549, 101001, 24065, '<td valign="top">How creative!  Was this your vanishing point subject, too?  ;-)  Very nice phot -- I gave it a high mark.</td>', 'How creative!  Was this your vanishing point subject, too?  ;-)  Very nice phot -- I gave it a high mark.', '2004-09-01 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
