(888573, 101787, 7599, '<td valign="top">Love it!! I know some people may comment on the green tinge, but I think it''s great. Original and well done.</td>', 'Love it!! I know some people may comment on the green tinge, but I think it''s great. Original and well done.', '2004-09-01 18:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
