(888656, 101916, 21034, '<td valign="top">Great idea. The choice of clothing isn''t great, and I think the light could''ve been more striking.</td>', 'Great idea. The choice of clothing isn''t great, and I think the light could''ve been more striking.', '2004-09-01 19:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
