(888666, 101847, 7599, '<td valign="top">Well its not a Picasso or a Garfunkel but I like it. <br/>For a million dollars I''d give you a 10?? *wink*</td>', 'Well its not a Picasso or a Garfunkel but I like it. For a million dollars I''d give you a 10?? *wink*', '2004-09-01 19:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
