(888692, 101923, 10268, '<td valign="top">What''s the subject?  Yeah, there''s framing, but what are the trees framing?<br/> <br/>I don''t think you can really have a good photo without a subject.</td>', 'What''s the subject?  Yeah, there''s framing, but what are the trees framing? I don''t think you can really have a good photo without a subject.', '2004-09-01 19:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(888707, 100792, 10268, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Beautiful lighting and great contrast.  My only complaint is the bottom/middle is a little dark.    9.</td>', 'Awesome.  Beautiful lighting and great contrast.  My only complaint is the bottom/middle is a little dark.    9.', '2004-09-01 19:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(888710, 101376, 10268, '<td valign="top">That''s the biggest keyhole I''ve ever seen.  Or the smalles head, whichever.<br/> <br/>But great detail.  6.</td>', 'That''s the biggest keyhole I''ve ever seen.  Or the smalles head, whichever. But great detail.  6.', '2004-09-01 19:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(888717, 101693, 25459, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I like the popcan. But what on earth was your camera doing at the bottom of a popcan?</td>', 'Very nice shot, I like the popcan. But what on earth was your camera doing at the bottom of a popcan?', '2004-09-01 19:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(888721, 100521, 25459, '<td valign="top">This is a cool picture. I like the way the pillars separate the sections of greenery. Reminds me of one of those folding dividers people used to get dressed behind.</td>', 'This is a cool picture. I like the way the pillars separate the sections of greenery. Reminds me of one of those folding dividers people used to get dressed behind.', '2004-09-01 19:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
