(889323, 101464, 19952, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. After the challenge is over, I hope you go back and burn that bottom right corner a bit to even out the lighting, but this is a really nice photo even with the slight glare.</td>', 'I love this shot. After the challenge is over, I hope you go back and burn that bottom right corner a bit to even out the lighting, but this is a really nice photo even with the slight glare.', '2004-09-02 05:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
