(889334, 101470, 23016, '<td valign="top">I think that the trees doesn''t add nothing to the photo, the frame have to give more interest to the subject.</td>', 'I think that the trees doesn''t add nothing to the photo, the frame have to give more interest to the subject.', '2004-09-02 05:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
