(889397, 101519, 23016, '<td valign="top">Good shot but it would be better without the upper frame. It''s a piece of sky, not really interesting.</td>', 'Good shot but it would be better without the upper frame. It''s a piece of sky, not really interesting.', '2004-09-02 08:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(889405, 101277, 14656, '<td valign="top">The ball seems like a tiny speck and so far away. Since I think the ball is the subject of your image, it would''ve helped greatly to have snapped the pic while the ball was as close as possible to you. Even after it has passed through the uprights. Also the horizon is tilted and the image lacks vibrancy in the colors.</td>', 'The ball seems like a tiny speck and so far away. Since I think the ball is the subject of your image, it would''ve helped greatly to have snapped the pic while the ball was as close as possible to you. Even after it has passed through the uprights. Also the horizon is tilted and the image lacks vibrancy in the colors.', '2004-09-02 08:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(889406, 100388, 14656, '<td valign="top">Chalk up another comment on how your image should have fit the maximum dimensions of 640 pixels. Even if you doubled the size of this image, it wouldn''t be 640px. That being said, it''s hard to look at a thumbnail sized pic. The image is also rather uninteresting and appears to be a candid snapshot of a deer relieving itself.</td>', 'Chalk up another comment on how your image should have fit the maximum dimensions of 640 pixels. Even if you doubled the size of this image, it wouldn''t be 640px. That being said, it''s hard to look at a thumbnail sized pic. The image is also rather uninteresting and appears to be a candid snapshot of a deer relieving itself.', '2004-09-02 08:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(889411, 100504, 14656, '<td valign="top">Titles shouldn''t matter, but I think you mean "their" not "there." Image looks out of focus and heavily artifacted. Even if this were a technically perfect shot, it would still lack in the lighting department, as well as fail to hold my interest.</td>', 'Titles shouldn''t matter, but I think you mean "their" not "there." Image looks out of focus and heavily artifacted. Even if this were a technically perfect shot, it would still lack in the lighting department, as well as fail to hold my interest.', '2004-09-02 08:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
