(889608, 101578, 12661, '<td valign="top">I find that the negative space below the span is detracting from the image. It would appear more balanced if you cropped at the first cross bar or maybe even used the span to make the bottom border. Aside from the composition, the colors and texture of the sky are spectacular. Very good use of backlighting as well.</td>', 'I find that the negative space below the span is detracting from the image. It would appear more balanced if you cropped at the first cross bar or maybe even used the span to make the bottom border. Aside from the composition, the colors and texture of the sky are spectacular. Very good use of backlighting as well.', '2004-09-02 11:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(889609, 101024, 23440, '<td valign="top">stunning picture, not the best for this challenge though...</td>', 'stunning picture, not the best for this challenge though...', '2004-09-02 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(889611, 101317, 23440, '<td valign="top">amazing, but wheres the framing???</td>', 'amazing, but wheres the framing???', '2004-09-02 11:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(889612, 101614, 23440, '<td valign="top">crooked</td>', 'crooked', '2004-09-02 11:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
