(890030, 101881, 21183, '<td valign="top">Clear photo and at an unusual angle. The car door provides a light summery frame.  The red  truck creates a bright splash of contrast and creates a sense of ''depth''.  A strange, unusual, thought provoking image.</td>', 'Clear photo and at an unusual angle. The car door provides a light summery frame.  The red  truck creates a bright splash of contrast and creates a sense of ''depth''.  A strange, unusual, thought provoking image.', '2004-09-02 17:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
