(890034, 100493, 21183, '<td valign="top">An unusual framing at an unusual angle.  I like it.  Lovely tones of green (and wood) and light and shade.</td>', 'An unusual framing at an unusual angle.  I like it.  Lovely tones of green (and wood) and light and shade.', '2004-09-02 17:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
