(890046, 100852, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image..very well thought out. The fact that the background figure is of a brighter colour helps enormously to make the picture work.<br/>Absolutely perfect for the challenge.....bumping up to 9</td>', 'I like the composition of this image..very well thought out. The fact that the background figure is of a brighter colour helps enormously to make the picture work.Absolutely perfect for the challenge.....bumping up to 9', '2004-09-02 17:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(890049, 101928, 24136, '<td valign="top">I like this concept but I wish the model was more in focus.</td>', 'I like this concept but I wish the model was more in focus.', '2004-09-02 17:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(890053, 101358, 21183, '<td valign="top">No doubts about this meeting the challenge and the use of an old tyre to frame the boats works really well.  The focussing seems spot on.  I''d like to see a few less things in it though, it seems a bit ''busy''.</td>', 'No doubts about this meeting the challenge and the use of an old tyre to frame the boats works really well.  The focussing seems spot on.  I''d like to see a few less things in it though, it seems a bit ''busy''.', '2004-09-02 17:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(890056, 100852, 21183, '<td valign="top">Super idea!  The lighting (and the framing) and the focus really works for me on this one.  I''d have been tempted to crop a bit tighter though, if it was mine. An 8.</td>', 'Super idea!  The lighting (and the framing) and the focus really works for me on this one.  I''d have been tempted to crop a bit tighter though, if it was mine. An 8.', '2004-09-02 17:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(890058, 101847, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the way the fencing here not only creates a frame (which improves the image on a compositional level) but also provides a context by communicating the bird''s captive status. Black and white works very well. Catchlights in the eyes are just right. Nicely out of focus plants in background add interest but don''t distract. Excellent!</td>', 'I love the way the fencing here not only creates a frame (which improves the image on a compositional level) but also provides a context by communicating the bird''s captive status. Black and white works very well. Catchlights in the eyes are just right. Nicely out of focus plants in background add interest but don''t distract. Excellent!', '2004-09-02 17:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(890061, 101934, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the frame itself - the shape, viewpoint and textures are great. I''m not as keen on the view that is being framed, I just don''t find it very appealing. Did you take any similar shots from some of the other tunnels? Just wondered.</td>', 'I really like the frame itself - the shape, viewpoint and textures are great. I''m not as keen on the view that is being framed, I just don''t find it very appealing. Did you take any similar shots from some of the other tunnels? Just wondered.', '2004-09-02 17:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(890063, 101746, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the shape of the opening but find the foreground frame is essentially just providing an uneven border here rather than being an object in it''s own right. That said, I like the image very much. The composition of what one can see through the frame is excellent - position of the lighthouse works very well. Cloud detail provides nice balance.</td>', 'I like the shape of the opening but find the foreground frame is essentially just providing an uneven border here rather than being an object in it''s own right. That said, I like the image very much. The composition of what one can see through the frame is excellent - position of the lighthouse works very well. Cloud detail provides nice balance.', '2004-09-02 17:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(890064, 101875, 21183, '<td valign="top">Novel idea for this challenge and quite fitting.  I''m fascinated that the reflection is ''upside down'', which holds my attention.  Only detracted by the bottles etc behind and around the mirror.  By you having centred the main image I feel it could be suggestive of the lens of a camera with an image captured within it.</td>', 'Novel idea for this challenge and quite fitting.  I''m fascinated that the reflection is ''upside down'', which holds my attention.  Only detracted by the bottles etc behind and around the mirror.  By you having centred the main image I feel it could be suggestive of the lens of a camera with an image captured within it.', '2004-09-02 18:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(890065, 100777, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea and I like the clean, modern result. I''d personally crop a touch more from the bottom.</td>', 'Lovely idea and I like the clean, modern result. I''d personally crop a touch more from the bottom.', '2004-09-02 18:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(890066, 100815, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever interpretation with nice dual meaning added by title, though works even without it.</td>', 'Clever interpretation with nice dual meaning added by title, though works even without it.', '2004-09-02 18:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(890067, 101455, 3087, '<td valign="top">Looking out? Hope he has an accurate aim. Witty, though not original. Nicely done.</td>', 'Looking out? Hope he has an accurate aim. Witty, though not original. Nicely done.', '2004-09-02 18:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(890073, 101718, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... it just needed to be centered slightly better.</td>', 'Nice shot... it just needed to be centered slightly better.', '2004-09-02 18:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(890074, 100717, 24459, '<td valign="top">I believe you could have used the frame much better in this shot. <br/>It looks purely like a effortless snaphot (forgive me being nasty - but these are my feelings - Im not saying you put no effort, only I can''t see it here).<br/>Nice object, but doesnt appeal to me at all. On top of that it''s slightly tilted.</td>', 'I believe you could have used the frame much better in this shot. It looks purely like a effortless snaphot (forgive me being nasty - but these are my feelings - Im not saying you put no effort, only I can''t see it here).Nice object, but doesnt appeal to me at all. On top of that it''s slightly tilted.', '2004-09-02 18:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(890075, 101376, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a superbly realised keyhole peeper photo. The eye contact works very well, the choice to show just that amount of nose and mouth and face is also spot on. The slight tilt of the face is just right. Lighting works. All in all this comes together well. Whereas normally I''d prefer to see detail in the foreground subject (such that it not be simply a custom border shape) I think that''s not relevant when the shape itself is as recognisable as a keyhole shape. Am I right to assume this is not a real keyhole but a much larger one cut into card?</td>', 'What a superbly realised keyhole peeper photo. The eye contact works very well, the choice to show just that amount of nose and mouth and face is also spot on. The slight tilt of the face is just right. Lighting works. All in all this comes together well. Whereas normally I''d prefer to see detail in the foreground subject (such that it not be simply a custom border shape) I think that''s not relevant when the shape itself is as recognisable as a keyhole shape. Am I right to assume this is not a real keyhole but a much larger one cut into card?', '2004-09-02 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(890077, 101824, 21183, '<td valign="top">The leaves of the trees provide a natural frame.</td>', 'The leaves of the trees provide a natural frame.', '2004-09-02 18:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(890082, 101933, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like how the framing provides an understanding of the environment and also how the two gravestones are alone in the field. Unusual.</td>', 'I like how the framing provides an understanding of the environment and also how the two gravestones are alone in the field. Unusual.', '2004-09-02 18:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(890083, 101934, 21183, '<td valign="top">Well framed.  I like the sepia tones too, which work well for this photo.</td>', 'Well framed.  I like the sepia tones too, which work well for this photo.', '2004-09-02 18:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(890086, 101582, 24459, '<td valign="top">Despite the frame (not too obvious, but present) I must admit I dislike this picture. <br/>There is something distracting about the center of the flower which makes me want to move to next pic quickly.<br/>The most important thing is that I really dont like pictures of flowers (macro shots) as there are so many of them it is terribly borring. It takes a siriously GREAT picture of a flower to make me score it high, and your picture doesn''t have it. Sorry</td>', 'Despite the frame (not too obvious, but present) I must admit I dislike this picture. There is something distracting about the center of the flower which makes me want to move to next pic quickly.The most important thing is that I really dont like pictures of flowers (macro shots) as there are so many of them it is terribly borring. It takes a siriously GREAT picture of a flower to make me score it high, and your picture doesn''t have it. Sorry', '2004-09-02 18:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(890088, 101275, 24459, '<td valign="top">You missed the frame. And the shot itself is average (of course the view is great but the picture is not). Try harder with color/saturation/contrast levels and next time read the topic instructions more carefully. Good luck</td>', 'You missed the frame. And the shot itself is average (of course the view is great but the picture is not). Try harder with color/saturation/contrast levels and next time read the topic instructions more carefully. Good luck', '2004-09-02 18:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
