(890296, 101860, 93, '<td valign="top">I am very impressed with the centering of the opening here, and the color of the yellow. It is *extremely* even, and it''s a color that gives most people (and digital cameras) a fit.. due to white balance.  The fact that you''ve also got the girl''s face lit wonderfully and in focus is further genius.  My only suggestion would be to somehow find a way to make the lower half of the opening (her upper body) darker.  A wondefully captured piece.</td>', 'I am very impressed with the centering of the opening here, and the color of the yellow. It is *extremely* even, and it''s a color that gives most people (and digital cameras) a fit.. due to white balance.  The fact that you''ve also got the girl''s face lit wonderfully and in focus is further genius.  My only suggestion would be to somehow find a way to make the lower half of the opening (her upper body) darker.  A wondefully captured piece.', '2004-09-02 21:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(890299, 100397, 93, '<td valign="top">If this shot had been a *little* less tilted, I would have scored it an extra point.  It''s a *gorgeous* framing work.. but the tilt juusst puts it off for me.</td>', 'If this shot had been a *little* less tilted, I would have scored it an extra point.  It''s a *gorgeous* framing work.. but the tilt juusst puts it off for me.', '2004-09-02 21:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
