(890352, 101881, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the colors.  I don''t think it fits the challenge as I understand it. It seems more of a reflection than a framing of something in the background.  I know there''s some disagreement about the guidelines for this challenge, but I am trying to be fair and consistent.<br/> <br/>I came back and re-read and re-read and finally believe this does fit the challenge.  I updated the score accordingly.  Very nice photo.  I personally don''t like the title -- but since that wasn''t part of the challenge I let it go ;-)</td>', 'I like the colors.  I don''t think it fits the challenge as I understand it. It seems more of a reflection than a framing of something in the background.  I know there''s some disagreement about the guidelines for this challenge, but I am trying to be fair and consistent. I came back and re-read and re-read and finally believe this does fit the challenge.  I updated the score accordingly.  Very nice photo.  I personally don''t like the title -- but since that wasn''t part of the challenge I let it go ;-)', '2004-09-02 22:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
