(890368, 101799, 24065, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very creative and beautiful photo.  We all seem to be struggling with the guidelines for this challenge, and I am trying very hard to be fair.  I don''t think this fits the guidelines as I understand them.  It appears to be more of a reflection than a framing.  But it is very nice.<br/> <br/>After re-reading the guidlines several times, I came back to reconsider this photo because it is so pleasing.  I do think it fits the challenge and have raised the score accordingly.  Good luck ;-)</td>', 'I think this is a very creative and beautiful photo.  We all seem to be struggling with the guidelines for this challenge, and I am trying very hard to be fair.  I don''t think this fits the guidelines as I understand them.  It appears to be more of a reflection than a framing.  But it is very nice. After re-reading the guidlines several times, I came back to reconsider this photo because it is so pleasing.  I do think it fits the challenge and have raised the score accordingly.  Good luck ;-)', '2004-09-02 22:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
