(890441, 101001, 22671, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture.  Everything seems very consistent about the picture.  It totally looks like a vintage picture from say the late sixties/early seventies.  I was wondering, did you try taking a few shots with the tv monitor opening perfectly centered in the picture (i.e. crop the tv dials on the right or show more of the tv on the left)?  This type of shot just seems to lend itself to using perfect symmetry.  Just curious.  Still a great picture though.</td>', 'Very cool picture.  Everything seems very consistent about the picture.  It totally looks like a vintage picture from say the late sixties/early seventies.  I was wondering, did you try taking a few shots with the tv monitor opening perfectly centered in the picture (i.e. crop the tv dials on the right or show more of the tv on the left)?  This type of shot just seems to lend itself to using perfect symmetry.  Just curious.  Still a great picture though.', '2004-09-02 23:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(890442, 101875, 25150, '<td valign="top">i like it alot, the face needs to be a bit lighter,</td>', 'i like it alot, the face needs to be a bit lighter,', '2004-09-02 23:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
