(890532, 101746, 22010, '<td valign="top">Very focused. I really admire that. Also, I SEE A FRAME! If it were up to me, you''d have 1 of the 3 ribbons.</td>', 'Very focused. I really admire that. Also, I SEE A FRAME! If it were up to me, you''d have 1 of the 3 ribbons.', '2004-09-03 00:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
