(890535, 101496, 15800, '<td valign="top">I would''ve maybe put some type of focal point in between the parallel lines.  Right now, my eye goes all around the picture, and not to the "vanishing" sidewalk as I think that you were meaning it to be.  Otherwise, great capture.</td>', 'I would''ve maybe put some type of focal point in between the parallel lines.  Right now, my eye goes all around the picture, and not to the "vanishing" sidewalk as I think that you were meaning it to be.  Otherwise, great capture.', '2004-09-03 00:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(890536, 101376, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  I would have liked to have seen it either bumped up in saturation, or converted to a BW or sepia, or duotone, etc.  It''s a little flat to me.</td>', 'Good concept.  I would have liked to have seen it either bumped up in saturation, or converted to a BW or sepia, or duotone, etc.  It''s a little flat to me.', '2004-09-03 01:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
