(890551, 101634, 16790, '<td valign="top">This could be made much more appealing with some slight tweaking.  A bit of sharpening, some toying with levels to give it more contrast and maybe a bit of noise, and perhaps conversion to black and white - I think these things would give the photograph more interest and a healthy dose of mood.  The composition is nice, and the framing is unique.</td>', 'This could be made much more appealing with some slight tweaking.  A bit of sharpening, some toying with levels to give it more contrast and maybe a bit of noise, and perhaps conversion to black and white - I think these things would give the photograph more interest and a healthy dose of mood.  The composition is nice, and the framing is unique.', '2004-09-03 01:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
