(890585, 101001, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Great concept. Actually a very nice image within the frame too. Color and detail and lighting, all very good. I like this shot very much. Only thing I might suggest for improvement, if possible would be to maybe lower the angle slightly, or try somehow to get the trees in the right lower so there was only sky above the tv frame. This is definitely one of my favorites of the challenge though. Nice job.</td>', 'Very clever. Great concept. Actually a very nice image within the frame too. Color and detail and lighting, all very good. I like this shot very much. Only thing I might suggest for improvement, if possible would be to maybe lower the angle slightly, or try somehow to get the trees in the right lower so there was only sky above the tv frame. This is definitely one of my favorites of the challenge though. Nice job.', '2004-09-03 01:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(890590, 101924, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow, very spectacular. I love the colors. Nice shot.</td>', 'Wow, very spectacular. I love the colors. Nice shot.', '2004-09-03 01:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
