(890614, 101520, 18197, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. I can "see" the wind. I can "feel" the sound of the surf. I can "smell" the light on the water. You have done a fantastic job of appealing to all the senses. (10)</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. I can "see" the wind. I can "feel" the sound of the surf. I can "smell" the light on the water. You have done a fantastic job of appealing to all the senses. (10)', '2004-09-03 02:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(890615, 101479, 19831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Very nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Very nice composition.', '2004-09-03 02:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(890616, 100082, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully framed. The steel pillar in the foreground does an excellant job framing and thereby drawing visual attention to the foggy bridge in the background. Colors are terrific. Focus, DOF and so on are good workmanlike mastery of the camera. Well done. (10)</td>', 'Wonderfully framed. The steel pillar in the foreground does an excellant job framing and thereby drawing visual attention to the foggy bridge in the background. Colors are terrific. Focus, DOF and so on are good workmanlike mastery of the camera. Well done. (10)', '2004-09-03 02:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(890618, 101807, 18197, '<td valign="top">Frankly this is not the traditional framing I had expected, but effective at highlighting the misty/foggy/cloudy sky. In the end, it is a beautiful capture and one of the best photos in this week''s challenge. (9)</td>', 'Frankly this is not the traditional framing I had expected, but effective at highlighting the misty/foggy/cloudy sky. In the end, it is a beautiful capture and one of the best photos in this week''s challenge. (9)', '2004-09-03 02:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(890619, 101693, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Great composition. One of my favorites of the challenge. Nice job.</td>', 'Very creative. Great composition. One of my favorites of the challenge. Nice job.', '2004-09-03 02:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(890621, 101847, 18197, '<td valign="top">A perfect example of a well framed shot. Congratulations on the technically perfect capture/edit. Comp, focus, DOF, lighting, color, levels ... all virtually perfect. Plus, the subject makes me smile. Thanks. (9)</td>', 'A perfect example of a well framed shot. Congratulations on the technically perfect capture/edit. Comp, focus, DOF, lighting, color, levels ... all virtually perfect. Plus, the subject makes me smile. Thanks. (9)', '2004-09-03 02:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(890623, 100662, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Among my top 10 picks for this challenge. I like the atmosphere you''ve given the shot with color and focus. Clearly meets the challenge, and nicely frames the subject. (9)</td>', 'Nice job. Among my top 10 picks for this challenge. I like the atmosphere you''ve given the shot with color and focus. Clearly meets the challenge, and nicely frames the subject. (9)', '2004-09-03 02:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(890625, 101815, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a much more interesting and complex image than the thumbnail lead me to expect. The lighting and focus on the stone is very very good. And the focus on the bridge (fortunately aided by the haze which will cover some sins) is excellent. Based on trying a similar shot, I kow this isn''t so easy. Well done. (9)</td>', 'This is a much more interesting and complex image than the thumbnail lead me to expect. The lighting and focus on the stone is very very good. And the focus on the bridge (fortunately aided by the haze which will cover some sins) is excellent. Based on trying a similar shot, I kow this isn''t so easy. Well done. (9)', '2004-09-03 02:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(890627, 101787, 18197, '<td valign="top">I don''t much care for the style of this picture but have to give credit where credit is due. It nicely meets the challenge. It is technically virtually flawless. And it carries a nice emotional punch. Among my top picks this time out. (9)</td>', 'I don''t much care for the style of this picture but have to give credit where credit is due. It nicely meets the challenge. It is technically virtually flawless. And it carries a nice emotional punch. Among my top picks this time out. (9)', '2004-09-03 02:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(890628, 101800, 18197, '<td valign="top">As I was thinking about the challenge, this was the first image that came to mind and one I was unsuccessful capturing with the style and grace you gave this one. You have executed it flawlessly. I like the high key approach. Composition, focus, DOF, levels are perfect. Very very well done. Among my top 10 this time out. (9)</td>', 'As I was thinking about the challenge, this was the first image that came to mind and one I was unsuccessful capturing with the style and grace you gave this one. You have executed it flawlessly. I like the high key approach. Composition, focus, DOF, levels are perfect. Very very well done. Among my top 10 this time out. (9)', '2004-09-03 02:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(890629, 101170, 18197, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand the title but I sure like your capture of this moody countenance. Nicely framed with plenty of emotional punch. Great job.</td>', 'Don''t understand the title but I sure like your capture of this moody countenance. Nicely framed with plenty of emotional punch. Great job.', '2004-09-03 02:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(890630, 101463, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge nicely and does a nice job capturing the city. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Fits the challenge nicely and does a nice job capturing the city. Among my top picks.', '2004-09-03 02:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(890632, 101423, 18197, '<td valign="top">Clever idea well executed. The levels and reflections are terrific. Composition is interesting. While it technically meets the challenge, the real strength of the photo is the right half, and it steals the thunder from the left a bit. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Clever idea well executed. The levels and reflections are terrific. Composition is interesting. While it technically meets the challenge, the real strength of the photo is the right half, and it steals the thunder from the left a bit. Among my top picks.', '2004-09-03 02:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(890633, 101849, 18197, '<td valign="top">Much much better than the thumb would have lead me to expect. Nicely done and among my top picks.</td>', 'Much much better than the thumb would have lead me to expect. Nicely done and among my top picks.', '2004-09-03 02:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
