(891249, 101479, 9668, '<td valign="top">I think the title could have been alot more creative, like "Monet," "Bridge of Love," "Ponder." Something like that =). On a side note, you may have tried desaturating everything but the bridge.  Maybe if you had a deeper DOF and a slower shutter speed to blend the water more and make it look more glassy. These are just ideas. This image is composed well, put nicely on the RoT (rule of thirds). Rocks in the background seem a bit overexposed, did you try darkening the image overall? Nice image, but could use some touch ups. PM me if you have any questions.</td>', 'I think the title could have been alot more creative, like "Monet," "Bridge of Love," "Ponder." Something like that =). On a side note, you may have tried desaturating everything but the bridge.  Maybe if you had a deeper DOF and a slower shutter speed to blend the water more and make it look more glassy. These are just ideas. This image is composed well, put nicely on the RoT (rule of thirds). Rocks in the background seem a bit overexposed, did you try darkening the image overall? Nice image, but could use some touch ups. PM me if you have any questions.', '2004-09-03 15:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
