(891347, 101776, 15919, '<td valign="top">Like the framing and the image is pretty cool.  Seems to contain pretty high level of noise.  I´ve nothing against grain but the digital noise can do a lot of damage for images for my opinion.  Pinsharp, maybe oversharpened (adds noise).  Would have given it thighter croping, cutting out the building on the left.  Fine image though.</td>', 'Like the framing and the image is pretty cool.  Seems to contain pretty high level of noise.  I´ve nothing against grain but the digital noise can do a lot of damage for images for my opinion.  Pinsharp, maybe oversharpened (adds noise).  Would have given it thighter croping, cutting out the building on the left.  Fine image though.', '2004-09-03 15:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
