(891392, 101787, 9668, '<td valign="top">Some people may not like this because it isn''t a normal/typical frame, but I do. Not quite sure on the green tint, I think it should be deep purple. JK =). Black and white may look nice too, but green is different. Great emotion, fitting title, technically flawless (that I can see) besides it not being deep purple. No, really, nice image.</td>', 'Some people may not like this because it isn''t a normal/typical frame, but I do. Not quite sure on the green tint, I think it should be deep purple. JK =). Black and white may look nice too, but green is different. Great emotion, fitting title, technically flawless (that I can see) besides it not being deep purple. No, really, nice image.', '2004-09-03 15:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
