(891404, 101826, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awsome! Cat photos are usaully voted down on DPC, but that is a great capture, love the green eyes, green leaves. Great details, composition lighting. Only thing that annoys me is the imperfections in the leaves, but basic editing, nothing you could do. Excellent job.</td>', 'Awsome! Cat photos are usaully voted down on DPC, but that is a great capture, love the green eyes, green leaves. Great details, composition lighting. Only thing that annoys me is the imperfections in the leaves, but basic editing, nothing you could do. Excellent job.', '2004-09-03 15:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(891411, 101285, 9668, '<td valign="top">The frame does nothing for me, I don''t know why it is there other than to meet the challenge. I like the movement, that works. Good detail</td>', 'The frame does nothing for me, I don''t know why it is there other than to meet the challenge. I like the movement, that works. Good detail', '2004-09-03 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
