(892456, 101946, 25355, '<td valign="top">A great sports shot (and I''m not even fond of baseball). However, what is the foreground subject that frames it? If it''s the near part of the circle, it extends into the background.</td>', 'A great sports shot (and I''m not even fond of baseball). However, what is the foreground subject that frames it? If it''s the near part of the circle, it extends into the background.', '2004-09-04 08:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
