(892487, 101524, 19248, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Well composed, interesting composition.  10</td>', 'WOW.  Well composed, interesting composition.  10', '2004-09-04 09:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(892488, 101659, 19248, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.   I realize this part was beyond your control, but the white shirted person &amp; the TV are  big distractions.</td>', 'Cool idea.   I realize this part was beyond your control, but the white shirted person & the TV are  big distractions.', '2004-09-04 09:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(892489, 101673, 19248, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I think your frame is great.  Nothing says one element has to make up the frame or that it must be  sided. IMO</td>', 'Great shot.  I think your frame is great.  Nothing says one element has to make up the frame or that it must be  sided. IMO', '2004-09-04 09:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(892490, 101862, 19248, '<td valign="top">Stunning.   Wish the background was sharper, &amp; the foreground frame fuzzier, but the horse would be fuzzy as a result.  good job.</td>', 'Stunning.   Wish the background was sharper, & the foreground frame fuzzier, but the horse would be fuzzy as a result.  good job.', '2004-09-04 09:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(892491, 101915, 19248, '<td valign="top">Great concept, love how you use the grass for the frame.  Like the B &amp; W too.</td>', 'Great concept, love how you use the grass for the frame.  Like the B & W too.', '2004-09-04 09:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(892493, 101487, 19248, '<td valign="top">Interesting frame.</td>', 'Interesting frame.', '2004-09-04 09:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(892495, 101385, 6999, '<td valign="top">The sheer level of contrast prevents this from working for me - so much bright, so much dark, and I would imagine the interesting stuff - the texture of the bark of that tree, the patterning and tones of green in the far bank - happens in a very restricted middle ground. Besides that, htere doesn''t seem to be much very striking about the scene anyway - no special moment of light, unusualness of location. There''s a hint, in the very left of frame, that the grss beside the lake/riveer and the dappling of the sunlight through brances might make a good image, but whether you could have made that fit the challenge, I don''t know. But for all those points, I think you''re not far off here: wait for the light, try to control the exposure in the sky - perhaps some fill flash to give detail in the shadows? - and perhaps, compositionally, just allow a little more foreground, and i think you''d have a very restful photograph.</td>', 'The sheer level of contrast prevents this from working for me - so much bright, so much dark, and I would imagine the interesting stuff - the texture of the bark of that tree, the patterning and tones of green in the far bank - happens in a very restricted middle ground. Besides that, htere doesn''t seem to be much very striking about the scene anyway - no special moment of light, unusualness of location. There''s a hint, in the very left of frame, that the grss beside the lake/riveer and the dappling of the sunlight through brances might make a good image, but whether you could have made that fit the challenge, I don''t know. But for all those points, I think you''re not far off here: wait for the light, try to control the exposure in the sky - perhaps some fill flash to give detail in the shadows? - and perhaps, compositionally, just allow a little more foreground, and i think you''d have a very restful photograph.', '2004-09-04 09:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(892497, 101855, 23620, '<td valign="top">Loved the colors</td>', 'Loved the colors', '2004-09-04 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(892499, 101468, 23620, '<td valign="top">Liked the lizard</td>', 'Liked the lizard', '2004-09-04 09:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(892500, 101768, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good solid primary colours add a strong element to this shot, despite a sense that the saturation might fractionally have been pushed too far. Lihgt is good, control of exposure is good, even those slightly over-exposed areas of cloud and wheels don;t detract for me. Strong sense of compositional balance too. There''s a little impression of lacking detail - like a soft-focus kind of effect, which may, looking at the hard edges of the leaves, simply be compression artefacts. I see that it''s under 90KB - perhaps a little more information would give it a further edge. Like it though - a very happy shot.</td>', 'Good solid primary colours add a strong element to this shot, despite a sense that the saturation might fractionally have been pushed too far. Lihgt is good, control of exposure is good, even those slightly over-exposed areas of cloud and wheels don;t detract for me. Strong sense of compositional balance too. There''s a little impression of lacking detail - like a soft-focus kind of effect, which may, looking at the hard edges of the leaves, simply be compression artefacts. I see that it''s under 90KB - perhaps a little more information would give it a further edge. Like it though - a very happy shot.', '2004-09-04 09:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(892544, 101850, 19982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at (what''s in the reflection), but I love the colors and the repeated geometrical forms are enticing.  Good luck ont he challenge!</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at (what''s in the reflection), but I love the colors and the repeated geometrical forms are enticing.  Good luck ont he challenge!', '2004-09-04 10:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(892579, 101520, 25090, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull photo</td>', 'Wonderfull photo', '2004-09-04 11:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(892608, 101517, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very good framing and the exposure seems ok.  Would have given it a thighter croping from above and from right.</td>', 'Very good framing and the exposure seems ok.  Would have given it a thighter croping from above and from right.', '2004-09-04 12:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(892611, 100624, 18157, '<td valign="top">I really love your photo. You are very creative. I can''t wait to see more from you.</td>', 'I really love your photo. You are very creative. I can''t wait to see more from you.', '2004-09-04 12:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
