(892622, 101927, 15919, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and I think this image surely has some potentials.  There are some fringes, maybe because of "wrong" usage of USM(?, to large radius?).  Dont know but the image is fine.</td>', 'Great exposure and I think this image surely has some potentials.  There are some fringes, maybe because of "wrong" usage of USM(?, to large radius?).  Dont know but the image is fine.', '2004-09-04 12:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
