(893137, 101588, 19248, '<td valign="top">should have locked focus on the subject not the frame.</td>', 'should have locked focus on the subject not the frame.', '2004-09-04 20:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(893139, 101845, 19248, '<td valign="top">Satellite dish is a big distraction.</td>', 'Satellite dish is a big distraction.', '2004-09-04 20:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(893141, 101657, 21083, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Should finish high. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Should finish high. 10', '2004-09-04 20:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(893142, 101870, 19248, '<td valign="top">Cool concept, wish the subject was of more interest.</td>', 'Cool concept, wish the subject was of more interest.', '2004-09-04 20:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(893143, 101853, 21083, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this photo adds to it''s beauty.</td>', 'The simplicity of this photo adds to it''s beauty.', '2004-09-04 20:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(893144, 101502, 19248, '<td valign="top">Sorry this looks like a snapshot to me.</td>', 'Sorry this looks like a snapshot to me.', '2004-09-04 20:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(893145, 101823, 21467, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo and a good idea. Nice job!<br/> <br/>And I like the name, of course ;)</td>', 'Beautiful photo and a good idea. Nice job! And I like the name, of course ;)', '2004-09-04 20:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(893147, 100514, 21467, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery and lovely colors..</td>', 'Beautiful scenery and lovely colors..', '2004-09-04 20:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(893149, 100388, 21467, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2004-09-04 20:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(893153, 101807, 21467, '<td valign="top">Superb photo, but I don''t see how it fits the theme</td>', 'Superb photo, but I don''t see how it fits the theme', '2004-09-04 21:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(893158, 100667, 24642, '<td valign="top">Refreshingly different from the rest.  Good work.</td>', 'Refreshingly different from the rest.  Good work.', '2004-09-04 21:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(893166, 101479, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely picture that would be made much better by warming the tones a tad and perhaps adjusting the levels slightly.  The coolness really takes away from what could be a very serene scene.  The composition is excellent.</td>', 'This is a lovely picture that would be made much better by warming the tones a tad and perhaps adjusting the levels slightly.  The coolness really takes away from what could be a very serene scene.  The composition is excellent.', '2004-09-04 21:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(893168, 101001, 24951, '<td valign="top">I''m looking forward to reading the note for this one. I gave it a 10. A very creative response to the challenge. Good DOF and colour</td>', 'I''m looking forward to reading the note for this one. I gave it a 10. A very creative response to the challenge. Good DOF and colour', '2004-09-04 21:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(893169, 101520, 24951, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. This landscape really works for you.</td>', 'Very beautiful. This landscape really works for you.', '2004-09-04 21:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(893171, 101501, 24951, '<td valign="top">Clean simple - I happen to like door photos which is in your favor. Nice framing A 10</td>', 'Clean simple - I happen to like door photos which is in your favor. Nice framing A 10', '2004-09-04 21:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(893174, 101746, 24951, '<td valign="top">Great clarity. Like the tint and tone and frame. 10</td>', 'Great clarity. Like the tint and tone and frame. 10', '2004-09-04 21:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(893175, 101823, 24951, '<td valign="top">Creative, cool, hey nice hand! Good looking model woo hoo! b&amp;w: good call as is blur of model''s head and clean image of hand. Love it. Good luck on this challenge!</td>', 'Creative, cool, hey nice hand! Good looking model woo hoo! b&w: good call as is blur of model''s head and clean image of hand. Love it. Good luck on this challenge!', '2004-09-04 21:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(893176, 101858, 24951, '<td valign="top">I think this deserves a 10. Nice use of black</td>', 'I think this deserves a 10. Nice use of black', '2004-09-04 21:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(893184, 100664, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the deep DOF for this!  The textures are stunning.  10</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the deep DOF for this!  The textures are stunning.  10', '2004-09-04 21:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(893189, 100418, 16790, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  I like the toning on this one, and the composition is flawless - very pleasing to the eye.  Excellent textures.  Just beautiful.  10</td>', 'Gorgeous.  I like the toning on this one, and the composition is flawless - very pleasing to the eye.  Excellent textures.  Just beautiful.  10', '2004-09-04 21:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(893192, 101813, 16790, '<td valign="top">This has a great deal of appeal.  The clarity is all around excellent; many interesting textures are visible throughout the image.  The contrast is just right.  Lovely!</td>', 'This has a great deal of appeal.  The clarity is all around excellent; many interesting textures are visible throughout the image.  The contrast is just right.  Lovely!', '2004-09-04 21:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(893193, 101463, 16790, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting and excellent composition.  Nice job!</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting and excellent composition.  Nice job!', '2004-09-04 21:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(893194, 101775, 16790, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous... really makes me miss the mountains!  Stunning clarity in this, the details are so crisp without contributing any excess noise.  Lovely.  10</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous... really makes me miss the mountains!  Stunning clarity in this, the details are so crisp without contributing any excess noise.  Lovely.  10', '2004-09-04 21:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(893197, 101543, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites in the challenge.  The vivid colours contrasting with the neutral tones surrounding the glass, the clarity, the textures and symmetry - all of it is fantastic.  Beautifull framed.  Wonderful job!  10</td>', 'This is one of my favourites in the challenge.  The vivid colours contrasting with the neutral tones surrounding the glass, the clarity, the textures and symmetry - all of it is fantastic.  Beautifull framed.  Wonderful job!  10', '2004-09-04 21:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(893198, 100687, 16790, '<td valign="top">Flawless.  Black and white works fantastically, composition is excellent, contrast and brightness are right on; the detail level is excellent.  10</td>', 'Flawless.  Black and white works fantastically, composition is excellent, contrast and brightness are right on; the detail level is excellent.  10', '2004-09-04 21:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(893205, 101737, 16790, '<td valign="top">The idea is very clever, but there are a couple of things that stop this from being an interesting image for me: the textured white item behind the red box, the blue foreground, and the position of the hand.  I closer crop on the upper half would probably have  balanced it out more in the absence of more hand to the left side; as it is, it feels like too much hand is missing and too much finger is visible.  A white foreground and background (or any colour, but it would look nice if the foreground and background matched) would also have made this feel less like a snapshot - it might also look nice in black and white, or maybe a selective desat with only red showing.  Overall, while I think this one could be improved, the idea is very clever, and it does meet the challenge well.</td>', 'The idea is very clever, but there are a couple of things that stop this from being an interesting image for me: the textured white item behind the red box, the blue foreground, and the position of the hand.  I closer crop on the upper half would probably have  balanced it out more in the absence of more hand to the left side; as it is, it feels like too much hand is missing and too much finger is visible.  A white foreground and background (or any colour, but it would look nice if the foreground and background matched) would also have made this feel less like a snapshot - it might also look nice in black and white, or maybe a selective desat with only red showing.  Overall, while I think this one could be improved, the idea is very clever, and it does meet the challenge well.', '2004-09-04 21:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(893209, 100814, 16790, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked nicer without the heavy green tones - maybe even in black and white or toned to a sepia.  It feels a tad neon with the green highlights overpowering the sunshine that''s breaking through the trees; some curves and a touch of sharpening would also improve the appeal.  With those minor changes, though, this would be a fantastic photo.  The scenery is well framed and it has a very balanced feel about it.</td>', 'I think this would have looked nicer without the heavy green tones - maybe even in black and white or toned to a sepia.  It feels a tad neon with the green highlights overpowering the sunshine that''s breaking through the trees; some curves and a touch of sharpening would also improve the appeal.  With those minor changes, though, this would be a fantastic photo.  The scenery is well framed and it has a very balanced feel about it.', '2004-09-04 21:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(893228, 100719, 16148, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  One of the best in the challenge.  I like the angle you chose.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very interesting image.  One of the best in the challenge.  I like the angle you chose.  Good luck.', '2004-09-04 22:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
