(893447, 100797, 25464, '<td valign="top">I just didn''t find the composition of this photo very appealing.  It seemed like a stretch to try to find something to frame for the challenge.</td>', 'I just didn''t find the composition of this photo very appealing.  It seemed like a stretch to try to find something to frame for the challenge.', '2004-09-05 00:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
