(893468, 100669, 19982, '<td valign="top">You should make sure you take full advantage of the 640 pixel limit.  You''ll find that people on this site tend to vote low for small images...</td>', 'You should make sure you take full advantage of the 640 pixel limit.  You''ll find that people on this site tend to vote low for small images...', '2004-09-05 01:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(893471, 101788, 19982, '<td valign="top">I know others have complained about incomplete frames, so I just want to go out of my way to say I love the way this photo is framed.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I know others have complained about incomplete frames, so I just want to go out of my way to say I love the way this photo is framed.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 01:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(893474, 101944, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, except there''s nothing in the frame.  If the clouds were in it, or maybe if the pic was in color... it seems a touch boring like this.</td>', 'I like the concept here, except there''s nothing in the frame.  If the clouds were in it, or maybe if the pic was in color... it seems a touch boring like this.', '2004-09-05 01:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(893476, 101345, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the imperfections in the frame here - chipped paint and what-not.  The dog looks almost human.</td>', 'I like the imperfections in the frame here - chipped paint and what-not.  The dog looks almost human.', '2004-09-05 01:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(893477, 101199, 2000, '<td valign="top">Frame what?</td>', 'Frame what?', '2004-09-05 01:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(893478, 101643, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  And don''t let anyone tell you they don''t like the border you put on this photo!  :-)  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  And don''t let anyone tell you they don''t like the border you put on this photo!  :-)  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 01:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(893481, 101912, 2000, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the trees silouhetted against the deep blue sky is quite nice here.  The sunset is well-framed by the trees, though I would like to see this photo maybe a few minutes later just to cut the intesity of the sun.  I don''t think the blow out is necessary to capture what you''re shooting in this, and I think the colors of the sunset would be more vivid if the sun had set just a bit more.</td>', 'The contrast of the trees silouhetted against the deep blue sky is quite nice here.  The sunset is well-framed by the trees, though I would like to see this photo maybe a few minutes later just to cut the intesity of the sun.  I don''t think the blow out is necessary to capture what you''re shooting in this, and I think the colors of the sunset would be more vivid if the sun had set just a bit more.', '2004-09-05 01:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(893484, 100716, 19982, '<td valign="top">Next time you might want to take full advantage of the 640 pixel limit.  You''ll find that the people here tend to vote lower on small images.</td>', 'Next time you might want to take full advantage of the 640 pixel limit.  You''ll find that the people here tend to vote lower on small images.', '2004-09-05 01:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(893485, 101596, 2000, '<td valign="top">The arch sets the scene here very nicely.  I like how you captured the buildings of the ranch within the ''frame'' so there is nothing of civilization aside from the power line outside of it.  It is nice to see that you did not cut out that line, as it seems to fit well in this pic. 8</td>', 'The arch sets the scene here very nicely.  I like how you captured the buildings of the ranch within the ''frame'' so there is nothing of civilization aside from the power line outside of it.  It is nice to see that you did not cut out that line, as it seems to fit well in this pic. 8', '2004-09-05 01:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(893487, 100505, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  I love the framing, I love the background. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  I love the framing, I love the background. Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 01:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(893488, 101800, 2000, '<td valign="top">The letterbox frame you''ve used fits well in to the whole photograph - and normally I wouldn''t consider the frame to be a real part of the pic.  I understand what you''re going for, and it''s well executed in this shot. 8 for now.</td>', 'The letterbox frame you''ve used fits well in to the whole photograph - and normally I wouldn''t consider the frame to be a real part of the pic.  I understand what you''re going for, and it''s well executed in this shot. 8 for now.', '2004-09-05 01:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(893490, 101291, 2000, '<td valign="top">This photo needs a bit of rotation, probably to make the pink building in the back (with the clock) straight vertically.  The issue here is that the photo feels off-balance because nothing is level.  I understand the brick wall being a bit crooked, and that works well here.  But the subject (pink building) being tilted needs to be corrected. 6</td>', 'This photo needs a bit of rotation, probably to make the pink building in the back (with the clock) straight vertically.  The issue here is that the photo feels off-balance because nothing is level.  I understand the brick wall being a bit crooked, and that works well here.  But the subject (pink building) being tilted needs to be corrected. 6', '2004-09-05 01:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(893491, 101045, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like that the folks on the beach have their own sort of sub-frame with that branch.  Nicely captured. 7</td>', 'I like that the folks on the beach have their own sort of sub-frame with that branch.  Nicely captured. 7', '2004-09-05 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(893495, 100227, 2000, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit too much of the frame, and therefore not enough of the background here, IMO.  I think if this were cropped tighter, perhaps cutting the left and right in to the circles next to the center squares would be the right correction.  I do, however, appreciate what you''re shooting, and I like the overall idea of the shot.</td>', 'There''s a bit too much of the frame, and therefore not enough of the background here, IMO.  I think if this were cropped tighter, perhaps cutting the left and right in to the circles next to the center squares would be the right correction.  I do, however, appreciate what you''re shooting, and I like the overall idea of the shot.', '2004-09-05 01:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(893498, 101428, 2000, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting and macro-detail on the framing plant; I also really like the DOF making the sun defocused in favor of very sharp focus on the plant. 8 for now.</td>', 'Nice backlighting and macro-detail on the framing plant; I also really like the DOF making the sun defocused in favor of very sharp focus on the plant. 8 for now.', '2004-09-05 01:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(893502, 101360, 2000, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but maybe I''m missing the framing aspect?</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but maybe I''m missing the framing aspect?', '2004-09-05 01:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(893504, 101024, 23439, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here. Almost looks like a painting. Well done.</td>', 'I like the colors here. Almost looks like a painting. Well done.', '2004-09-05 01:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(893505, 100643, 2000, '<td valign="top">L''effetto di silouhette della gru è molto piacevole ed i colori bloccati fanno un buon contrasto.  (The silouhette effect of the crane is very nice, and the colors captured make a good contrast.) 8</td>', 'L''effetto di silouhette della gru è molto piacevole ed i colori bloccati fanno un buon contrasto.  (The silouhette effect of the crane is very nice, and the colors captured make a good contrast.) 8', '2004-09-05 01:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(893506, 100777, 2000, '<td valign="top">Like a hall of mirrors, only without the mirrors.  I like the effect, and that you''ve chosen an unconventional approach to this challenge.</td>', 'Like a hall of mirrors, only without the mirrors.  I like the effect, and that you''ve chosen an unconventional approach to this challenge.', '2004-09-05 01:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(893508, 100397, 19982, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great shot!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 01:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(893515, 101315, 2000, '<td valign="top">Unless that box framed by the leaves at the bottom left is part of the shot, it should have been removed - I can''t tell what it is.  Otherwise, I like the framing done by the window and plants, but I would kind of like to see what the cat is looking at.  If there was a bird or something in the shot I think it would make a little more sense.</td>', 'Unless that box framed by the leaves at the bottom left is part of the shot, it should have been removed - I can''t tell what it is.  Otherwise, I like the framing done by the window and plants, but I would kind of like to see what the cat is looking at.  If there was a bird or something in the shot I think it would make a little more sense.', '2004-09-05 01:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(893516, 101496, 2000, '<td valign="top">I see the rule of thirds is a major influence on this photograph, and it works here.</td>', 'I see the rule of thirds is a major influence on this photograph, and it works here.', '2004-09-05 01:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(893517, 101543, 2000, '<td valign="top">Good combination of negative space and framing to focus my eye on the windows.  If not for the title, however, I don''t know that I would have noticed the cross.  In any case, very effective interpretation of the challenge, and I think the windows make a good framing subject.</td>', 'Good combination of negative space and framing to focus my eye on the windows.  If not for the title, however, I don''t know that I would have noticed the cross.  In any case, very effective interpretation of the challenge, and I think the windows make a good framing subject.', '2004-09-05 01:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(893519, 101519, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful framing - no detail is lost, and it''s a stunning view.  Focus is flawless.  10</td>', 'Beautiful framing - no detail is lost, and it''s a stunning view.  Focus is flawless.  10', '2004-09-05 01:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(893521, 101522, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the warm tones in this; it really gives the photograph a nice, comfortable feeling while still remaining exotic.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the warm tones in this; it really gives the photograph a nice, comfortable feeling while still remaining exotic.', '2004-09-05 01:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(893522, 101941, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow...  I hope this was a very long telephoto!  Great shot, I hope you do well in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow...  I hope this was a very long telephoto!  Great shot, I hope you do well in the challenge.', '2004-09-05 01:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(893523, 100388, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the framing done here, and the birdhouse and fence play an active role in focusing my attention to the deer.  For future reference, try to make your submitted photo as large as you can if your camera will support you doing so - max size is 640px, and your pic is 293px on its long side; max file size is 150k, and yours is about 40k.</td>', 'I like the framing done here, and the birdhouse and fence play an active role in focusing my attention to the deer.  For future reference, try to make your submitted photo as large as you can if your camera will support you doing so - max size is 640px, and your pic is 293px on its long side; max file size is 150k, and yours is about 40k.', '2004-09-05 01:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(893524, 101933, 2000, '<td valign="top">Nice use of desaturation on the green color here - the contrast of the stones makes them the clear focus of the shot and helps to emphacize them in the frame.</td>', 'Nice use of desaturation on the green color here - the contrast of the stones makes them the clear focus of the shot and helps to emphacize them in the frame.', '2004-09-05 01:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(893527, 101933, 16790, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  One of my favourites in this challenge - everything is so crisp and clear, and the scenery is absolutely gorgeous.  The subject matter and the title tie together to make it moving as well.  The green toning is interesting - I wouldn''t have thought of it myself, but it seems to suit the photo.  Fabulous job - 10</td>', 'Stunning.  One of my favourites in this challenge - everything is so crisp and clear, and the scenery is absolutely gorgeous.  The subject matter and the title tie together to make it moving as well.  The green toning is interesting - I wouldn''t have thought of it myself, but it seems to suit the photo.  Fabulous job - 10', '2004-09-05 01:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(893529, 101520, 16790, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous.  This is the sort of photo I''ve tried so hard to take along the coast, and I''ve just never managed.  Beautiful work.  10</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous.  This is the sort of photo I''ve tried so hard to take along the coast, and I''ve just never managed.  Beautiful work.  10', '2004-09-05 01:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(893531, 101657, 16790, '<td valign="top">The warm light really gives this one atmosphere - it''s inviting, peaceful, and very pleasing to the eye.  Gorgeous view, DOF is perfect, and the composition is excellent.  10</td>', 'The warm light really gives this one atmosphere - it''s inviting, peaceful, and very pleasing to the eye.  Gorgeous view, DOF is perfect, and the composition is excellent.  10', '2004-09-05 01:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(893534, 101675, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The choice of black and white for this was a good one.  The lighting is perfect for the scene - nothing is too deeply shadowed or blown out.  Excellent work - 10</td>', 'Lovely.  The choice of black and white for this was a good one.  The lighting is perfect for the scene - nothing is too deeply shadowed or blown out.  Excellent work - 10', '2004-09-05 01:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(893537, 101847, 16790, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  Very cute photo, and it''s well composed.  I like the duotone, and the framing seems to suit the subject well.  My only complaint is that it looks perhaps slightly oversharpened, but that could just be the grain of the photo, which I like.  Nice job!</td>', 'Adorable!  Very cute photo, and it''s well composed.  I like the duotone, and the framing seems to suit the subject well.  My only complaint is that it looks perhaps slightly oversharpened, but that could just be the grain of the photo, which I like.  Nice job!', '2004-09-05 02:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(893540, 101677, 16790, '<td valign="top">While this definitely fits the challenge, I don''t personally find it particularly interesting, and it feels a tad imbalanced with more white to the right and top than the bottom.  Also, the blown out whites contrast just a tad too much with the shutters and the view (to my eyes, anyway).  The shutters also clash a bit with the view, which is not, in itself, very interesting.  Overall, I do like the photo - it has the potential to have very vivid colours, and it''s very creatively done - but I would like if it felt a bit more balanced.</td>', 'While this definitely fits the challenge, I don''t personally find it particularly interesting, and it feels a tad imbalanced with more white to the right and top than the bottom.  Also, the blown out whites contrast just a tad too much with the shutters and the view (to my eyes, anyway).  The shutters also clash a bit with the view, which is not, in itself, very interesting.  Overall, I do like the photo - it has the potential to have very vivid colours, and it''s very creatively done - but I would like if it felt a bit more balanced.', '2004-09-05 02:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(893544, 101822, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty, and I like the symmetry of the composition.  The colour feels slightly flat, though.. it lacks warmth; it might benefit from conversion to a duotone, or a tiny bit of levels tweaking - of course, that might also throw away the detail of the candle.  At any rate, it''s a unique photo that meets the challange fairly well.</td>', 'This is very pretty, and I like the symmetry of the composition.  The colour feels slightly flat, though.. it lacks warmth; it might benefit from conversion to a duotone, or a tiny bit of levels tweaking - of course, that might also throw away the detail of the candle.  At any rate, it''s a unique photo that meets the challange fairly well.', '2004-09-05 02:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(893546, 100249, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very emotive image.  I like the choice of black and white, and the detail is excellent.  Good job :)</td>', 'Very emotive image.  I like the choice of black and white, and the detail is excellent.  Good job :)', '2004-09-05 02:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(893547, 101800, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very clever - I like this one a lot.  Black and white is perfect for the photo, which is clear and well taken.  Good work!</td>', 'Very clever - I like this one a lot.  Black and white is perfect for the photo, which is clear and well taken.  Good work!', '2004-09-05 02:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(893551, 101001, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  Focus is good, and the colours are vibrant.  A little more contrast might look nice, but it''s great just how it is, too.  Good job :)</td>', 'Very creative!  Focus is good, and the colours are vibrant.  A little more contrast might look nice, but it''s great just how it is, too.  Good job :)', '2004-09-05 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(893552, 101622, 16790, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Both the foreground and the background are interesting, and the focus looks great.  Exposure is ideal.  Fantastic photograph!</td>', 'Stunning.  Both the foreground and the background are interesting, and the focus looks great.  Exposure is ideal.  Fantastic photograph!', '2004-09-05 02:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(893555, 100050, 16790, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea, and the colours all work fantastically together.  Beautiful photograph - no complaints whatsoever :)</td>', 'Awesome idea, and the colours all work fantastically together.  Beautiful photograph - no complaints whatsoever :)', '2004-09-05 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(893559, 101826, 16790, '<td valign="top">What an adorable kitty!  This is a gorgeous shot, with the cat''s eyes matching the leaves so well; the composition makes it very pleasing to the eye.  Nice shot!</td>', 'What an adorable kitty!  This is a gorgeous shot, with the cat''s eyes matching the leaves so well; the composition makes it very pleasing to the eye.  Nice shot!', '2004-09-05 02:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(893561, 101488, 16790, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  It has a nice feeling of grit about it, which is complimented by the duotone.  I would also like to see this in black and white.  Excellent detail level, and a fantastic job in choosing interesting subject matter.</td>', 'Love this shot.  It has a nice feeling of grit about it, which is complimented by the duotone.  I would also like to see this in black and white.  Excellent detail level, and a fantastic job in choosing interesting subject matter.', '2004-09-05 02:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(893562, 101933, 24659, '<td valign="top">Nice gothic feel to it.</td>', 'Nice gothic feel to it.', '2004-09-05 02:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(893564, 101520, 16301, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Taken at the right time...</td>', 'Beautiful! Taken at the right time...', '2004-09-05 02:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(893598, 101495, 3724, '<td valign="top">Assuredly your image is much better than your spelling......  very good colour work on this.</td>', 'Assuredly your image is much better than your spelling......  very good colour work on this.', '2004-09-05 03:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(893631, 101820, 22392, '<td valign="top">i am very curious what this one looked like in color. As it is, it looks a bit flat. Perhaps you used the wrong method for turning it into B&amp;W?</td>', 'i am very curious what this one looked like in color. As it is, it looks a bit flat. Perhaps you used the wrong method for turning it into B&W?', '2004-09-05 03:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
