(893836, 101944, 23312, '<td valign="top">Great idea - I with the cloud or something else were actually in the "frame".</td>', 'Great idea - I with the cloud or something else were actually in the "frame".', '2004-09-05 12:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(893838, 101908, 2000, '<td valign="top">A little dark, IMO.  I see the framing aspect of the wall border, but it''s quite hard to see.</td>', 'A little dark, IMO.  I see the framing aspect of the wall border, but it''s quite hard to see.', '2004-09-05 12:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(893839, 101001, 23312, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but cropping out 3 sides of the tv and not the top feels a bit awkward to me - I''d either lower the angle to get more sky through the tv and crop the top, or else widen the vew a bit.</td>', 'Great idea, but cropping out 3 sides of the tv and not the top feels a bit awkward to me - I''d either lower the angle to get more sky through the tv and crop the top, or else widen the vew a bit.', '2004-09-05 12:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(893841, 101497, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the multiple levels of framing captured here.</td>', 'I like the multiple levels of framing captured here.', '2004-09-05 12:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(893842, 101001, 19959, '<td valign="top">I thought of an idea along these lines (no pun intended!) This is very clever, but something about the final composition doesn''t work for me. I suspect because you felt that you needed to show more of the scene to prove that this is a real shot.... <br/> <br/>This would be cool under advanced editing, where perhaps you could desatuarate the scene within the TV.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'I thought of an idea along these lines (no pun intended!) This is very clever, but something about the final composition doesn''t work for me. I suspect because you felt that you needed to show more of the scene to prove that this is a real shot....  This would be cool under advanced editing, where perhaps you could desatuarate the scene within the TV. Good luck', '2004-09-05 12:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(893843, 101930, 20433, '<td valign="top">A little to dark.</td>', 'A little to dark.', '2004-09-05 12:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(893847, 101743, 19959, '<td valign="top">too much dark silhouette in the lower left. Might have worked better with a tighter crop on the top right window and cityscape.</td>', 'too much dark silhouette in the lower left. Might have worked better with a tighter crop on the top right window and cityscape.', '2004-09-05 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(893849, 101515, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2004-09-05 12:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(893852, 101578, 19959, '<td valign="top">Great framing of the people. This shot works well</td>', 'Great framing of the people. This shot works well', '2004-09-05 12:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(893859, 100838, 19959, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, this appears really dark. I can''t see the framing.</td>', 'I''m sorry, this appears really dark. I can''t see the framing.', '2004-09-05 12:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(893861, 101622, 19982, '<td valign="top">I really like the outer frame and the beautiful building in the background (excellent contrast!), but the middle frame going right through the building just kind of ruins the effect otherwise I think this would be a top scorer.  Still giving high marks.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the outer frame and the beautiful building in the background (excellent contrast!), but the middle frame going right through the building just kind of ruins the effect otherwise I think this would be a top scorer.  Still giving high marks.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-05 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(893864, 101673, 19982, '<td valign="top">What can I say?  I''m a sucker for silky smooth waterfalls!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'What can I say?  I''m a sucker for silky smooth waterfalls!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 12:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(893865, 101007, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the tree works beautifully as the frame here.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love the colors and the tree works beautifully as the frame here.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 12:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(893889, 101911, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the idea...  it might have been better cropping either higher up or else keeping the rest of the legs (all the way to the feet) in the scene.  It''s generally a no-no cropping mid-calf.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'I like the idea...  it might have been better cropping either higher up or else keeping the rest of the legs (all the way to the feet) in the scene.  It''s generally a no-no cropping mid-calf.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2004-09-05 13:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(893896, 101007, 8759, '<td valign="top">Love the soft focus 7</td>', 'Love the soft focus 7', '2004-09-05 13:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(893898, 101622, 25952, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites....i cant decide if a different angle would have been better though so the bar is not right through the building? You probably had the bar right there intentionally which works well, i just cant decide if i like that part or not. awesome shot though- 9</td>', 'one of my favorites....i cant decide if a different angle would have been better though so the bar is not right through the building? You probably had the bar right there intentionally which works well, i just cant decide if i like that part or not. awesome shot though- 9', '2004-09-05 13:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(893908, 101285, 6870, '<td valign="top">If these are in your yard, PULL THEM OUT NOW WHILE YOU HAVE A CHANCE! They will take over the world! I like the movement here, and the framing, though I don''t know what it is, makes the effect more intimate.</td>', 'If these are in your yard, PULL THEM OUT NOW WHILE YOU HAVE A CHANCE! They will take over the world! I like the movement here, and the framing, though I don''t know what it is, makes the effect more intimate.', '2004-09-05 13:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(893910, 101502, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really fine eye to catch this. Have you tried this in b/w? I think it might pull the viewer even more toward the face and expression.</td>', 'Really fine eye to catch this. Have you tried this in b/w? I think it might pull the viewer even more toward the face and expression.', '2004-09-05 13:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(893911, 100550, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones. A bit oversharpened, and perhaps a bit busy,too. I like the mottled light a lot.</td>', 'Lovely tones. A bit oversharpened, and perhaps a bit busy,too. I like the mottled light a lot.', '2004-09-05 13:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(893912, 101344, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well done. The colors here really work well. Framing put the focus right on the statue, but the flowers are also nice to explore. 9</td>', 'Well done. The colors here really work well. Framing put the focus right on the statue, but the flowers are also nice to explore. 9', '2004-09-05 13:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
