(893927, 101741, 19035, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, fits the challenge quite well, in my top 10 picks. - 9 -</td>', 'I like this very much, fits the challenge quite well, in my top 10 picks. - 9 -', '2004-09-05 14:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
