(893955, 101001, 25166, '<td valign="top">How many challenges does this picture cover? Like it.</td>', 'How many challenges does this picture cover? Like it.', '2004-09-05 14:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(893960, 101344, 24016, '<td valign="top">the flash on the foreground center takes away from  the composition a bit. the rest is nicely done and meets  the challenge in a cool way. well  done.</td>', 'the flash on the foreground center takes away from  the composition a bit. the rest is nicely done and meets  the challenge in a cool way. well  done.', '2004-09-05 14:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(893967, 100233, 24016, '<td valign="top">what is with the title?</td>', 'what is with the title?', '2004-09-05 14:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(894002, 100992, 25618, '<td valign="top">just a bit too grainy for me, but the idea is a good one and I do like it, however it would have been better if the graininess could have been eliminated.</td>', 'just a bit too grainy for me, but the idea is a good one and I do like it, however it would have been better if the graininess could have been eliminated.', '2004-09-05 15:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(894019, 101787, 18667, '<td valign="top">I adore this picture!  The green is a bit too pronounced, but otherwise it is great.</td>', 'I adore this picture!  The green is a bit too pronounced, but otherwise it is great.', '2004-09-05 15:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(894026, 100397, 18667, '<td valign="top">Top 10 image here in my opinion.</td>', 'Top 10 image here in my opinion.', '2004-09-05 15:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(894027, 100082, 18667, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking image.  I love the perspective.</td>', 'Breathtaking image.  I love the perspective.', '2004-09-05 15:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(894028, 101928, 10084, '<td valign="top">I think that cropping out the sky would eliminate the distraction in the composition. Otherwise this is an excellent shot.  The symmetry feels very good and pleasing to the eye. "8"</td>', 'I think that cropping out the sky would eliminate the distraction in the composition. Otherwise this is an excellent shot.  The symmetry feels very good and pleasing to the eye. "8"', '2004-09-05 15:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(894031, 100837, 18667, '<td valign="top">One of the best of the group in my opinion.  It captures a story well and fits the topic perfectly.</td>', 'One of the best of the group in my opinion.  It captures a story well and fits the topic perfectly.', '2004-09-05 15:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(894033, 101352, 18667, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t get much better than this.<br/> <br/>Fine work!</td>', 'It doesn''t get much better than this. Fine work!', '2004-09-05 15:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(894036, 101513, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like how you included the inside frame of the window. Very nice texture. The scene with the green trees and the blue sky is really brought out nicely with the exposure. A polarizer and or a neutral density may help the sky to really pop and complete the scene. "8"</td>', 'I like how you included the inside frame of the window. Very nice texture. The scene with the green trees and the blue sky is really brought out nicely with the exposure. A polarizer and or a neutral density may help the sky to really pop and complete the scene. "8"', '2004-09-05 15:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(894037, 100397, 10084, '<td valign="top">I feel that a closer crop would give this composition even more impact. The subject matter is extremely interesting backed by the beautiful clouds and the cityscape. "8"</td>', 'I feel that a closer crop would give this composition even more impact. The subject matter is extremely interesting backed by the beautiful clouds and the cityscape. "8"', '2004-09-05 15:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(894058, 101673, 23176, '<td valign="top">Great photo just don''t see the framing</td>', 'Great photo just don''t see the framing', '2004-09-05 16:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(894085, 101934, 10084, '<td valign="top">This composition really makes me want to buy a convertible car and race around the road enjoying the sun. Your eye follows the road from tunnel to tunnel. Love the duotone that you use for this shot. Contrast gives you a great feeling of the mountains rocky texture. "10"</td>', 'This composition really makes me want to buy a convertible car and race around the road enjoying the sun. Your eye follows the road from tunnel to tunnel. Love the duotone that you use for this shot. Contrast gives you a great feeling of the mountains rocky texture. "10"', '2004-09-05 16:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(894087, 101309, 10084, '<td valign="top">Thre green of the foliage really frames the subject very well. It helps to make the bird pop of the the scene."8"</td>', 'Thre green of the foliage really frames the subject very well. It helps to make the bird pop of the the scene."8"', '2004-09-05 16:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(894105, 101858, 10084, '<td valign="top">Love the vivid red color of the flower, it really brings your eyes toward the subject. The lighting from the top give it a dramatic feeling. The metal fence framing the subject makes for the perfect contrast to the soft texture of the flower. "10"</td>', 'Love the vivid red color of the flower, it really brings your eyes toward the subject. The lighting from the top give it a dramatic feeling. The metal fence framing the subject makes for the perfect contrast to the soft texture of the flower. "10"', '2004-09-05 17:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(894107, 101815, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene in which your eyes are lead from the top of the bottle toward the bottom where the bridge is framed. It would be nice to see have you go back to this scene and take a shot in which the sky for bluer and clouds where hanging about. Mother nature doesn''t always help out. "10" if you promise to go back one day to reshoot.</td>', 'Interesting scene in which your eyes are lead from the top of the bottle toward the bottom where the bridge is framed. It would be nice to see have you go back to this scene and take a shot in which the sky for bluer and clouds where hanging about. Mother nature doesn''t always help out. "10" if you promise to go back one day to reshoot.', '2004-09-05 17:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(894131, 101934, 25183, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  It does meet the challenge.  I''m drawn into the photo and feel like I am travelling down that road.  10</td>', 'I really like this one.  It does meet the challenge.  I''m drawn into the photo and feel like I am travelling down that road.  10', '2004-09-05 17:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(894135, 101268, 25183, '<td valign="top">Surely the best shot in framing!  Crisp image, I am drawn through to the background framed by the arch which remains the foreground subjec.  Great - 10</td>', 'Surely the best shot in framing!  Crisp image, I am drawn through to the background framed by the arch which remains the foreground subjec.  Great - 10', '2004-09-05 17:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(894154, 101860, 21714, '<td valign="top">Simple, Creative and Effective idea. Well done.</td>', 'Simple, Creative and Effective idea. Well done.', '2004-09-05 17:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(894156, 101675, 21714, '<td valign="top">Love the framing &amp; tones. Beautiful image.</td>', 'Love the framing & tones. Beautiful image.', '2004-09-05 18:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(894161, 100397, 21714, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite image in the challenge. It''s almost surreal. Great capture, well thought out. <br/> What I wish for is another version of the same image without excessive sharpening. <br/> <br/>Still is my favourite and still don''t like the halos.<br/></td>', 'This is my favourite image in the challenge. It''s almost surreal. Great capture, well thought out.  What I wish for is another version of the same image without excessive sharpening.  Still is my favourite and still don''t like the halos.', '2004-09-05 18:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(894162, 101788, 12194, '<td valign="top">to sharp...</td>', 'to sharp...', '2004-09-05 18:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(894167, 101468, 21714, '<td valign="top">I love the ''framing'' in this image. I am but a bit uneasy about not seeing the whole body. Well, of course, you don''t need to show the whole body. But the crop or composition isn''t right for me.  If it was somewhere  in the frame where it had some space to move around, I think it would look better. Again, for framing, I really like  how you have approached it.</td>', 'I love the ''framing'' in this image. I am but a bit uneasy about not seeing the whole body. Well, of course, you don''t need to show the whole body. But the crop or composition isn''t right for me.  If it was somewhere  in the frame where it had some space to move around, I think it would look better. Again, for framing, I really like  how you have approached it.', '2004-09-05 18:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(894168, 101725, 21714, '<td valign="top">This one made me stop and have a good look.  I love al lthe framing aspects of this image.  The only bit I am not really sure about is the angle you have chosen. Well, not just the angle, but the angle combined with the title. I guess it boils down to how we''re used to seeing a library.  <br/>I think you have done a brilliant job and wish you all the best.</td>', 'This one made me stop and have a good look.  I love al lthe framing aspects of this image.  The only bit I am not really sure about is the angle you have chosen. Well, not just the angle, but the angle combined with the title. I guess it boils down to how we''re used to seeing a library.  I think you have done a brilliant job and wish you all the best.', '2004-09-05 18:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(894172, 101634, 21714, '<td valign="top">I am not going into any technical details.  But I love the moment in time you have chosen to capture and I think you have a great eye.  If you see things like this  and work on shots, you will for sure capture great images. Well done. Best of luck.</td>', 'I am not going into any technical details.  But I love the moment in time you have chosen to capture and I think you have a great eye.  If you see things like this  and work on shots, you will for sure capture great images. Well done. Best of luck.', '2004-09-05 18:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(894194, 101921, 19608, '<td valign="top">Except for the challenge - this photo has an awful lot going for it.  Perfect exposure and composition - using colors that compliment each other very well.  On a pickie, pickie note - it should be rotated just a bit ccw.  The missing bars in the bopttom center of the window must have a story.  As for the "framing" bit - I guess you are framing the clouds.  Nice job.</td>', 'Except for the challenge - this photo has an awful lot going for it.  Perfect exposure and composition - using colors that compliment each other very well.  On a pickie, pickie note - it should be rotated just a bit ccw.  The missing bars in the bopttom center of the window must have a story.  As for the "framing" bit - I guess you are framing the clouds.  Nice job.', '2004-09-05 18:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(894212, 101851, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, and the human element really adds to it.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful image, and the human element really adds to it.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 19:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(894220, 101826, 22995, '<td valign="top">Great how the eyes match the leaves.  Great photo.</td>', 'Great how the eyes match the leaves.  Great photo.', '2004-09-05 19:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(894223, 101511, 22995, '<td valign="top">Beautiful spot, great picture.</td>', 'Beautiful spot, great picture.', '2004-09-05 19:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(894224, 101463, 19982, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous image.  Excellent time of day for just the right lighting.  Even the clouds helped mold this image into something special.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is a gorgeous image.  Excellent time of day for just the right lighting.  Even the clouds helped mold this image into something special.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 19:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(894225, 101113, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  I like it.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very interesting!  I like it.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 19:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(894253, 101822, 23956, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image, but I think it would serve the challenge criteria better if there were more difference between the pitchers (which I take to be your foreground) and the candle. You have depth, but I don''t really see foreground/background here. It would also be better, I think, if there were a bit more space around the outside edges, particularly the sides. With so much lovely space around the flame, the handles really look like they''re squeezing in to get in the shot. You might also consider getting a piece of fabric to function as a flooring, as the seams are very out of place and distracting among your lovely swirling forms and textures.</td>', 'This is a lovely image, but I think it would serve the challenge criteria better if there were more difference between the pitchers (which I take to be your foreground) and the candle. You have depth, but I don''t really see foreground/background here. It would also be better, I think, if there were a bit more space around the outside edges, particularly the sides. With so much lovely space around the flame, the handles really look like they''re squeezing in to get in the shot. You might also consider getting a piece of fabric to function as a flooring, as the seams are very out of place and distracting among your lovely swirling forms and textures.', '2004-09-05 20:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(894255, 101469, 23956, '<td valign="top">I love how you''ve tucked the shape of the building up into the spaces between the leaves. Well done.</td>', 'I love how you''ve tucked the shape of the building up into the spaces between the leaves. Well done.', '2004-09-05 20:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(894256, 101673, 22304, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, but I don''t see how it fits the challenge<br/></td>', 'very nice photo, but I don''t see how it fits the challenge', '2004-09-05 20:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(894258, 101524, 22304, '<td valign="top">nice shot!! Everything looks great,The vine on the left is a liitle distracting though, I may have moved to the right a bit to get more of his body in. Just my 2 cents...8</td>', 'nice shot!! Everything looks great,The vine on the left is a liitle distracting though, I may have moved to the right a bit to get more of his body in. Just my 2 cents...8', '2004-09-05 20:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(894261, 100797, 23956, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but all of your ''action'' is in the top and left of the image. The lower right quarter is entirely empty, and it gives this image a lopsided, top-heavy feel. A couple things would have really helped here. First, you could have taken this shot (assuming no interference) from a slightly higher angle to bring the fountain and buildings off the top edge. Then, a bit of greenery peeking out of the right (even if it''s just a couple blades of grass that you snatch up from the ground, and hold in the composition while you take the picture) would really complete the balance.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but all of your ''action'' is in the top and left of the image. The lower right quarter is entirely empty, and it gives this image a lopsided, top-heavy feel. A couple things would have really helped here. First, you could have taken this shot (assuming no interference) from a slightly higher angle to bring the fountain and buildings off the top edge. Then, a bit of greenery peeking out of the right (even if it''s just a couple blades of grass that you snatch up from the ground, and hold in the composition while you take the picture) would really complete the balance.', '2004-09-05 20:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(894264, 101866, 23956, '<td valign="top">Lovely and surreal. I don''t think that the flare spot does anything for the image, though. It is too geometric agains the flowing softness of the rest of your well-composed image.</td>', 'Lovely and surreal. I don''t think that the flare spot does anything for the image, though. It is too geometric agains the flowing softness of the rest of your well-composed image.', '2004-09-05 20:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(894265, 100194, 22304, '<td valign="top">I like the way the foreground leaves are dark and don''t take the focus away from the house. I''d like to know where this is?</td>', 'I like the way the foreground leaves are dark and don''t take the focus away from the house. I''d like to know where this is?', '2004-09-05 20:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(894267, 101577, 23956, '<td valign="top">If it were possible, removing those two white sticks on the right side of the image would really have helped to clean up and ''prettify'' this shot. That said, great shutter speed, exposure, and interest.</td>', 'If it were possible, removing those two white sticks on the right side of the image would really have helped to clean up and ''prettify'' this shot. That said, great shutter speed, exposure, and interest.', '2004-09-05 20:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(894269, 101790, 22304, '<td valign="top">nice composition, I''d like to see it on a brighter day</td>', 'nice composition, I''d like to see it on a brighter day', '2004-09-05 20:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(894272, 101916, 19035, '<td valign="top">2nd of this type os shot that Ive seen, both were done very well.  Good luck on your placement - 8 -</td>', '2nd of this type os shot that Ive seen, both were done very well.  Good luck on your placement - 8 -', '2004-09-05 20:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(894274, 101328, 23956, '<td valign="top">This might be more interesting if I had a clue what I am looking at. Unfortunately, I don''t. There are a lot of distracting elements in this shot. The bit of something sticking out into the shot on the right hand side, the shadow across the front, the bit of orange something (is that hose?) along the bottom... All of these things distract from the image, especially when the subject is not something that most people will be able to identify.</td>', 'This might be more interesting if I had a clue what I am looking at. Unfortunately, I don''t. There are a lot of distracting elements in this shot. The bit of something sticking out into the shot on the right hand side, the shadow across the front, the bit of orange something (is that hose?) along the bottom... All of these things distract from the image, especially when the subject is not something that most people will be able to identify.', '2004-09-05 20:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(894275, 101268, 22304, '<td valign="top">perfect shot ,great DOF and shadow detail</td>', 'perfect shot ,great DOF and shadow detail', '2004-09-05 20:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(894278, 101204, 23956, '<td valign="top">Great compisition! I love how you used something as foreground which also exists in the background, so that even though it is intentionally out of focus to not distract, it also doesn''t distract because we''re trying to figure out ''what are those blurry things blocking the view?'' Great exposure and I love the tone you used, much richer than the usual sepia. I also love how you managed to arrange the pose so that we can actually see her eyes through her shades, which can be very difficult to do!The only thing that I don''t like about this image is the bit of something sticking up above her head on the other side of the railing.</td>', 'Great compisition! I love how you used something as foreground which also exists in the background, so that even though it is intentionally out of focus to not distract, it also doesn''t distract because we''re trying to figure out ''what are those blurry things blocking the view?'' Great exposure and I love the tone you used, much richer than the usual sepia. I also love how you managed to arrange the pose so that we can actually see her eyes through her shades, which can be very difficult to do!The only thing that I don''t like about this image is the bit of something sticking up above her head on the other side of the railing.', '2004-09-05 20:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(894281, 101474, 23956, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Great compisition, good use of framing, an interesting subject, nice and clean but still interesting. (Fascinating, actually. I want to find one of those, it looks like fun!)</td>', 'Excellent! Great compisition, good use of framing, an interesting subject, nice and clean but still interesting. (Fascinating, actually. I want to find one of those, it looks like fun!)', '2004-09-05 20:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(894283, 100493, 23956, '<td valign="top">This would be better if you could have angled just a bit to cut out the metal gate on the right edge of the image. Great use of framing relevant to the subject.</td>', 'This would be better if you could have angled just a bit to cut out the metal gate on the right edge of the image. Great use of framing relevant to the subject.', '2004-09-05 20:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(894288, 101677, 23956, '<td valign="top">This one made me smile, just knowing that last week, somewhere in the world, a photographer was sitting in a playhouse watching the sunset. I think your flash was a bit too bright though. You might have done better with a flashlight shining on the back wall of the playhouse (since it is white it would have bounced to provede some illumination) and a longer exposure, which would have given you a more balanced exposure between the sunset and the inside of the playhouse.</td>', 'This one made me smile, just knowing that last week, somewhere in the world, a photographer was sitting in a playhouse watching the sunset. I think your flash was a bit too bright though. You might have done better with a flashlight shining on the back wall of the playhouse (since it is white it would have bounced to provede some illumination) and a longer exposure, which would have given you a more balanced exposure between the sunset and the inside of the playhouse.', '2004-09-05 20:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(894292, 101933, 22304, '<td valign="top">nice photo but I''m not sure of the about the color cast(green) It may look better B/W or sepia maybe IMO.</td>', 'nice photo but I''m not sure of the about the color cast(green) It may look better B/W or sepia maybe IMO.', '2004-09-05 20:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(894294, 101423, 23956, '<td valign="top">This shot really wouldn''t work with memory cards, would it? Very well done. I would have taken off the tape on the end of the film, it doesn''t add anything to the shot and ends up being as much of a focal point as the film canister.</td>', 'This shot really wouldn''t work with memory cards, would it? Very well done. I would have taken off the tape on the end of the film, it doesn''t add anything to the shot and ends up being as much of a focal point as the film canister.', '2004-09-05 20:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(894295, 101524, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think I would have flipped this portrait instead of landscape.  The focus is a bit off as well.</td>', 'I think I would have flipped this portrait instead of landscape.  The focus is a bit off as well.', '2004-09-05 20:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(894296, 101856, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really need to know how you got this shot, because this very shot has been eluding me.  The moon is GREAT, but the trees are a bit ragged.  I would almost rather seen the moon by itself framed simply by the sky.  People probably wouldn''t have gotten that though.  Good photo.</td>', 'I really need to know how you got this shot, because this very shot has been eluding me.  The moon is GREAT, but the trees are a bit ragged.  I would almost rather seen the moon by itself framed simply by the sky.  People probably wouldn''t have gotten that though.  Good photo.', '2004-09-05 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(894297, 101941, 22304, '<td valign="top">I like this shot being partial to lions (leo) nice DOF</td>', 'I like this shot being partial to lions (leo) nice DOF', '2004-09-05 20:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(894299, 100885, 25464, '<td valign="top">I dont really like this framing because it seems to cover up the subject instead of framing.  The boats are beautiful.</td>', 'I dont really like this framing because it seems to cover up the subject instead of framing.  The boats are beautiful.', '2004-09-05 20:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(894300, 101047, 25464, '<td valign="top">No subject in the frame.</td>', 'No subject in the frame.', '2004-09-05 20:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(894301, 101808, 25464, '<td valign="top">The frame is the subject.  Nice though.</td>', 'The frame is the subject.  Nice though.', '2004-09-05 20:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(894305, 101768, 22304, '<td valign="top">I love the colors</td>', 'I love the colors', '2004-09-05 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(894306, 101341, 25464, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit out of focus and blown out in the background</td>', 'Seems a bit out of focus and blown out in the background', '2004-09-05 21:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(894307, 101796, 23956, '<td valign="top">Yes, it meets the challenge. But as with every shot, you want to ask yourself if it makes sense. What does the hand and the wedding ring have to do with this fabulous building? If you want to prove that you were there, you could probably use this shot to show your friends, since they can also look at your hand and match them up. From the point of view of someone you don''t know, who wasn''t there, there''s no reason for the hand to be there. The idea of framing is that we get the sense of peeking through to see a scene. If I go to see this building, I don''t imagine that my first glimpse of it will be peeking through a space between anyone''s fingers. &lt;p&gt;There are three major parts to any good photo (in my opinion): What, How, and Why. You''ve got the what, this building is a great subject. You''ve got the How, I like the straight-on angle and the sense of mystery and surroundings created by the large shadow on the front wall. Now you just need to figure out Why you are taking a picture of this building, and if that Why is enhanced by this particular strategy. &lt;p&gt;Good luck to you, and Happy Shooting!</td>', 'Yes, it meets the challenge. But as with every shot, you want to ask yourself if it makes sense. What does the hand and the wedding ring have to do with this fabulous building? If you want to prove that you were there, you could probably use this shot to show your friends, since they can also look at your hand and match them up. From the point of view of someone you don''t know, who wasn''t there, there''s no reason for the hand to be there. The idea of framing is that we get the sense of peeking through to see a scene. If I go to see this building, I don''t imagine that my first glimpse of it will be peeking through a space between anyone''s fingers. <p>There are three major parts to any good photo (in my opinion): What, How, and Why. You''ve got the what, this building is a great subject. You''ve got the How, I like the straight-on angle and the sense of mystery and surroundings created by the large shadow on the front wall. Now you just need to figure out Why you are taking a picture of this building, and if that Why is enhanced by this particular strategy. <p>Good luck to you, and Happy Shooting!', '2004-09-05 21:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(894308, 101882, 23956, '<td valign="top">I particularly like how you arranged your light and used white cardboard to get the reflection in your eye. This would be much better, though, if the keyhole were more carefully cut out.</td>', 'I particularly like how you arranged your light and used white cardboard to get the reflection in your eye. This would be much better, though, if the keyhole were more carefully cut out.', '2004-09-05 21:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(894310, 101470, 25313, '<td valign="top">it''s JEB BUSH and family!!</td>', 'it''s JEB BUSH and family!!', '2004-09-05 21:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(894311, 101519, 25464, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene too far away.  I would have liked to see the scene in the center panel alone.</td>', 'A beautiful scene too far away.  I would have liked to see the scene in the center panel alone.', '2004-09-05 21:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(894314, 100693, 23956, '<td valign="top">Nice fence, and it matches the challenge, but something is definitely missing in this shot. What is on the other side of this fabulous fence that is worth taking a picture of? Please don''t think I''m trying to be harsh, but if you could find a bit of fence with something to look at on the other side, it would be much more worthwhile photographically.</td>', 'Nice fence, and it matches the challenge, but something is definitely missing in this shot. What is on the other side of this fabulous fence that is worth taking a picture of? Please don''t think I''m trying to be harsh, but if you could find a bit of fence with something to look at on the other side, it would be much more worthwhile photographically.', '2004-09-05 21:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(894316, 101847, 23956, '<td valign="top">Foreground and background make sense together, great focus, love the subject, excellent sharpness, lovely composition.... This shot has it all! Well done!</td>', 'Foreground and background make sense together, great focus, love the subject, excellent sharpness, lovely composition.... This shot has it all! Well done!', '2004-09-05 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(894323, 101602, 23956, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of depth here, but no discernable foreground and background.</td>', 'I see a lot of depth here, but no discernable foreground and background.', '2004-09-05 21:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(894325, 101935, 23956, '<td valign="top">The shells are distracting... could you have flipped the shower curtain backwards for this shot?</td>', 'The shells are distracting... could you have flipped the shower curtain backwards for this shot?', '2004-09-05 21:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(894326, 100502, 19982, '<td valign="top">Lovely!!!  I wish it were larger, but this is a beautiful photo.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'Lovely!!!  I wish it were larger, but this is a beautiful photo.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-09-05 21:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(894327, 100792, 23956, '<td valign="top">Great shot! This doesn''t fit the challenge under their definition of framing, so you''ll probably not do as well as this photo would in a better suited challenge, but it''s a great image regardless. The varied angles and expressions are great, and I like the sharp contrast.</td>', 'Great shot! This doesn''t fit the challenge under their definition of framing, so you''ll probably not do as well as this photo would in a better suited challenge, but it''s a great image regardless. The varied angles and expressions are great, and I like the sharp contrast.', '2004-09-05 21:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(894328, 101620, 23956, '<td valign="top">If he''s climbing in like that, I''m impressed! Good use of relevant framing, nice exposure and an interesting subject.</td>', 'If he''s climbing in like that, I''m impressed! Good use of relevant framing, nice exposure and an interesting subject.', '2004-09-05 21:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(894329, 101045, 23956, '<td valign="top">Your horizon is a bit tilted, but otherwise this is a very strong image. Well done.</td>', 'Your horizon is a bit tilted, but otherwise this is a very strong image. Well done.', '2004-09-05 21:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(894330, 101317, 19982, '<td valign="top">Well..  beautiful clouds and a wonderous view.  Not exactly "framed", but I like it nonetheless.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well..  beautiful clouds and a wonderous view.  Not exactly "framed", but I like it nonetheless.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-05 21:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(894333, 101655, 23956, '<td valign="top">Interesting and well done. I imagine, though, that it loses points since the foreground is not really identifiable, other than as some sort of railing or barricade.</td>', 'Interesting and well done. I imagine, though, that it loses points since the foreground is not really identifiable, other than as some sort of railing or barricade.', '2004-09-05 21:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(894335, 101644, 23956, '<td valign="top">It''s so fun to imagine the process of you taking this picture! Great tonal range. This might have been better if the leaves were a tiny bit lower in the image, though.</td>', 'It''s so fun to imagine the process of you taking this picture! Great tonal range. This might have been better if the leaves were a tiny bit lower in the image, though.', '2004-09-05 21:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(894340, 100835, 23956, '<td valign="top">Which bridge is this? Is it under the walkway to the stadium? I''ve never seen this view. Nice use ofwhite balance, I love the golden cement work combined with the blue on the batman building.</td>', 'Which bridge is this? Is it under the walkway to the stadium? I''ve never seen this view. Nice use ofwhite balance, I love the golden cement work combined with the blue on the batman building.', '2004-09-05 21:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(894341, 101922, 23956, '<td valign="top">Wow, building plaid! I love this! The angled composition really gives it that last oomph of unusual-ness.</td>', 'Wow, building plaid! I love this! The angled composition really gives it that last oomph of unusual-ness.', '2004-09-05 21:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(894345, 101911, 23956, '<td valign="top">Someone told me this once, and I''ve found it to be true: when cropping the human body, it always looks better if you avoid cropping near a joint. In this case, they are so low in the frame that it would make much more sense if you could gett all the way to their feet in the shot, but if you couldn''t get any farther back, the next best think would be to crop at mid-thigh. It also looks a little dead at this level of saturation. It would be improved a lot by either increasing saturation or converting to sepia or black and white.</td>', 'Someone told me this once, and I''ve found it to be true: when cropping the human body, it always looks better if you avoid cropping near a joint. In this case, they are so low in the frame that it would make much more sense if you could gett all the way to their feet in the shot, but if you couldn''t get any farther back, the next best think would be to crop at mid-thigh. It also looks a little dead at this level of saturation. It would be improved a lot by either increasing saturation or converting to sepia or black and white.', '2004-09-05 21:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(894347, 101543, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image...  I love the selective desat and the colors and the contrast and the patterns.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful image...  I love the selective desat and the colors and the contrast and the patterns.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 21:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(894349, 101508, 23956, '<td valign="top">Without the branch crossing her face, this would be much better. I like her in that segment of the window, though... Perhaps if the shot was taken from more to the right, you could have avoided it? Of course, that''s if you couldn''t reach to prune it.</td>', 'Without the branch crossing her face, this would be much better. I like her in that segment of the window, though... Perhaps if the shot was taken from more to the right, you could have avoided it? Of course, that''s if you couldn''t reach to prune it.', '2004-09-05 21:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(894353, 101470, 23956, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I wish we could see some expressions on the faces of the passengers. Next time, try putting something in the spot where you want people to look (a friend to get their attention, a sign that says Look here! or whatever.) I''d also recommend cropping about an inch from the bottom and the top.</td>', 'Nice, but I wish we could see some expressions on the faces of the passengers. Next time, try putting something in the spot where you want people to look (a friend to get their attention, a sign that says Look here! or whatever.) I''d also recommend cropping about an inch from the bottom and the top.', '2004-09-05 21:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(894357, 101496, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love it!  Each frame has a different image and quality to it and they all add up to one beautiful whole.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love it!  Each frame has a different image and quality to it and they all add up to one beautiful whole.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-05 21:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
