(895939, 101719, 21183, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  The arched frame ''blends'' into the scene beautifully.  The rest of the scene curves tantalisingly inwards towards the arch at the end of the street. Nice contrast made by the peachy colouring on the wall with the painting and shelved flower tubs.  I just wish there wasn''t the sky satellite dish there!  Still, that''s not your fault. An 8</td>', 'I really like this image.  The arched frame ''blends'' into the scene beautifully.  The rest of the scene curves tantalisingly inwards towards the arch at the end of the street. Nice contrast made by the peachy colouring on the wall with the painting and shelved flower tubs.  I just wish there wasn''t the sky satellite dish there!  Still, that''s not your fault. An 8', '2004-09-06 16:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(895943, 101514, 5354, '<td valign="top">Thumbnail size submission - can''t really tell whether its a good one or not - 5</td>', 'Thumbnail size submission - can''t really tell whether its a good one or not - 5', '2004-09-06 16:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
