(896467, 100516, 26238, '<td valign="top">This is a good concept, but for some reason I dont like the leaves in focus so much. They aren''t that pretty to look at. I would have placed more emphasis on the fire and not the leaves.</td>', 'This is a good concept, but for some reason I dont like the leaves in focus so much. They aren''t that pretty to look at. I would have placed more emphasis on the fire and not the leaves.', '2004-09-06 22:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
