(896489, 101112, 26238, '<td valign="top">Waiting for what? I think I see a bench in there. I definatly like the stone window thing, but I think I should be seeing something else in there. Even something simple, like a flower.  I also think the bench, (I wish i knew what it was), should have been made brighter somehow. It seems a bit too dark. But all in all, Lizzo likes.</td>', 'Waiting for what? I think I see a bench in there. I definatly like the stone window thing, but I think I should be seeing something else in there. Even something simple, like a flower.  I also think the bench, (I wish i knew what it was), should have been made brighter somehow. It seems a bit too dark. But all in all, Lizzo likes.', '2004-09-06 22:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
