(896510, 101911, 26238, '<td valign="top">Thats a sweet picture, and I think I like it alot. It makes me think college, seperate schools, and sneaking outside to meet one another and then saying goodbye. I can just think of a little plot in my head, I love pictures like that. Good job.</td>', 'Thats a sweet picture, and I think I like it alot. It makes me think college, seperate schools, and sneaking outside to meet one another and then saying goodbye. I can just think of a little plot in my head, I love pictures like that. Good job.', '2004-09-06 22:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
