(896578, 101059, 19608, '<td valign="top">A great idea - the tree/fence makes a nice frame.  Don''t think he tilt works this time.</td>', 'A great idea - the tree/fence makes a nice frame.  Don''t think he tilt works this time.', '2004-09-06 23:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(896581, 100600, 23338, '<td valign="top">Kinda cute, but "framing"?  Just don''t see it.</td>', 'Kinda cute, but "framing"?  Just don''t see it.', '2004-09-06 23:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(896584, 101268, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb.  Wonderful.  What I wouldn''t give to see a blue sky on this - you were robbed by nature.  Even with the sky - this is a GREAT submission.</td>', 'Superb.  Wonderful.  What I wouldn''t give to see a blue sky on this - you were robbed by nature.  Even with the sky - this is a GREAT submission.', '2004-09-06 23:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(896585, 101680, 23338, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I would have rated it higher, but the totally out of focus background made it really difficult for me to accept the image.  The bug on the plant stem was, I''m sure, supposed to be the "frame", but it''s just "there"; in the foreground.  It doesn''t really "frame", it just preceeds.   I''d work for greater depth of field and more balanced, all around, framing.</td>', 'Sorry, I would have rated it higher, but the totally out of focus background made it really difficult for me to accept the image.  The bug on the plant stem was, I''m sure, supposed to be the "frame", but it''s just "there"; in the foreground.  It doesn''t really "frame", it just preceeds.   I''d work for greater depth of field and more balanced, all around, framing.', '2004-09-06 23:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(896588, 101511, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I find the ruined tower too central. Maybe it would have been better if you had it slightly to the right, and showing more of the bay</td>', 'Nice shot but I find the ruined tower too central. Maybe it would have been better if you had it slightly to the right, and showing more of the bay', '2004-09-06 23:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(896590, 100436, 23338, '<td valign="top">There''s just not enough to this image for me to give it much in a rating.  Yep, I can tell the out of focus area is a key hole, but I really can''t "see" what is beyond.  So, as for framing something, the something seems missing.  Maybe more focus to the foreground and a lens setting that provides more image in the background would help.  Just my thoughts.  Good luck.</td>', 'There''s just not enough to this image for me to give it much in a rating.  Yep, I can tell the out of focus area is a key hole, but I really can''t "see" what is beyond.  So, as for framing something, the something seems missing.  Maybe more focus to the foreground and a lens setting that provides more image in the background would help.  Just my thoughts.  Good luck.', '2004-09-06 23:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(896592, 101795, 23338, '<td valign="top">My understanding is that the framing was to be in the foreground.  Nice colorful and focused photo otherwise.</td>', 'My understanding is that the framing was to be in the foreground.  Nice colorful and focused photo otherwise.', '2004-09-06 23:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(896593, 101746, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice simple photo with odd shape for the frame (a castle ruin window, I presume).</td>', 'Nice simple photo with odd shape for the frame (a castle ruin window, I presume).', '2004-09-06 23:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(896594, 100514, 25921, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot, but i don''t buy the framing</td>', 'wonderful shot, but i don''t buy the framing', '2004-09-06 23:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(896595, 101520, 25921, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2004-09-06 23:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(896597, 101317, 23338, '<td valign="top">Love those clouds.  However, as to framing, it would probably show better as a "frame" if you caught part of the airplane''s window around them.  The end of the wing just didn''t seem to act as a frame - only a foreground reference point.</td>', 'Love those clouds.  However, as to framing, it would probably show better as a "frame" if you caught part of the airplane''s window around them.  The end of the wing just didn''t seem to act as a frame - only a foreground reference point.', '2004-09-06 23:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(896599, 101673, 23338, '<td valign="top">I like the waterfall, but the rocks and plants really serve, for me at least, only as a foreground reference point, not really a frame.  Maybe if there were also some foreground leaves or rocks along the side of the image or across the top of the image, or at least in one of the corners, then maybe it would achieve the "framing" you were trying for ...  Just my suggestion.  Nice water though.</td>', 'I like the waterfall, but the rocks and plants really serve, for me at least, only as a foreground reference point, not really a frame.  Maybe if there were also some foreground leaves or rocks along the side of the image or across the top of the image, or at least in one of the corners, then maybe it would achieve the "framing" you were trying for ...  Just my suggestion.  Nice water though.', '2004-09-06 23:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(896600, 101460, 25921, '<td valign="top">great lines of sight, good photo</td>', 'great lines of sight, good photo', '2004-09-06 23:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(896603, 101863, 23338, '<td valign="top">So, is the fence the "framing" - or just the plants everywhere?  I''m confused as to how you were trying to frame and what you were trying to frame.  Whatever it was, it escapes me.  Sorry.   Good luck though.</td>', 'So, is the fence the "framing" - or just the plants everywhere?  I''m confused as to how you were trying to frame and what you were trying to frame.  Whatever it was, it escapes me.  Sorry.   Good luck though.', '2004-09-06 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(896605, 100838, 23338, '<td valign="top">It may be my monitor, but I have a really hard time discerning details in this photo.  Therefore, its hard to tell what has been framed and what hasn''t.  I''d go for a longer exposure and therefore more reflected light - and with a slightly lower line of sight, maybe the moon could be framed in those dark uprights.  Just my thought.  Good luck.</td>', 'It may be my monitor, but I have a really hard time discerning details in this photo.  Therefore, its hard to tell what has been framed and what hasn''t.  I''d go for a longer exposure and therefore more reflected light - and with a slightly lower line of sight, maybe the moon could be framed in those dark uprights.  Just my thought.  Good luck.', '2004-09-06 23:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(896606, 101495, 25921, '<td valign="top">This photo has a surrealistic quality to it that i like.  I''d like to learn what is in the foreground framing that ghostly building</td>', 'This photo has a surrealistic quality to it that i like.  I''d like to learn what is in the foreground framing that ghostly building', '2004-09-06 23:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(896612, 101466, 23338, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower, but what is the framing?  Are you trying to frame the center part of the flower with the petals?   Hmmm...  With the beautiful petals and the great detail in the water drops, the frame overpowers the subject.  If the greenery is the frame, it seems to be more in the background rather than in the foreground - where my understanding indicates the "frame" should be - and the frame in that case is not really all encompassing, it sort of borders the lower part of the image.  Anyway - as a flower, its really nice.  Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful flower, but what is the framing?  Are you trying to frame the center part of the flower with the petals?   Hmmm...  With the beautiful petals and the great detail in the water drops, the frame overpowers the subject.  If the greenery is the frame, it seems to be more in the background rather than in the foreground - where my understanding indicates the "frame" should be - and the frame in that case is not really all encompassing, it sort of borders the lower part of the image.  Anyway - as a flower, its really nice.  Good luck.', '2004-09-06 23:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(896617, 100516, 23338, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s preferences, but I would have tried for more fire detail and less flash fill on the framing leaves.   To me the emphasis should be on the subject being framed, and the frame should lend to the strength of that subject.  This just didn''t seem to accomplish it for me.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'Maybe it''s preferences, but I would have tried for more fire detail and less flash fill on the framing leaves.   To me the emphasis should be on the subject being framed, and the frame should lend to the strength of that subject.  This just didn''t seem to accomplish it for me.  Nice idea though.', '2004-09-06 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(896619, 101533, 23338, '<td valign="top">I thought the frame was supposed to be a foreground frame.  Nice photo otherwise though.</td>', 'I thought the frame was supposed to be a foreground frame.  Nice photo otherwise though.', '2004-09-06 23:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(896627, 101655, 23338, '<td valign="top">I have a lot of trouble "reading" this photo.  Maybe on a much brighter monitor, or printed in the right conditions, the framing would show up better.   Or maybe if the foreground vertical bars were slightly lit up with light from behind, it would establish some separation from the background.   I''d also like the same sense of detail in the lights along the water front that you seem to get in the reflections on the water.  Anyway, I understand the idea you were pursuing and sort of like it.  Good luck.</td>', 'I have a lot of trouble "reading" this photo.  Maybe on a much brighter monitor, or printed in the right conditions, the framing would show up better.   Or maybe if the foreground vertical bars were slightly lit up with light from behind, it would establish some separation from the background.   I''d also like the same sense of detail in the lights along the water front that you seem to get in the reflections on the water.  Anyway, I understand the idea you were pursuing and sort of like it.  Good luck.', '2004-09-06 23:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(896629, 101771, 23338, '<td valign="top">My problem with this image is that it is so busy and has so many areas out of focus.  If it were my image I would probably have tried for a slilght greater DOF and cropped out some of the closer apples.  Just my thoughts.  Good luck.</td>', 'My problem with this image is that it is so busy and has so many areas out of focus.  If it were my image I would probably have tried for a slilght greater DOF and cropped out some of the closer apples.  Just my thoughts.  Good luck.', '2004-09-06 23:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(896634, 101465, 23338, '<td valign="top">The lack of focus on the framing is what bothers me with this image.  It''s distracting - especially given the difference in color.  I like the background image though; a fitting scene for the subject.  Good luck.</td>', 'The lack of focus on the framing is what bothers me with this image.  It''s distracting - especially given the difference in color.  I like the background image though; a fitting scene for the subject.  Good luck.', '2004-09-06 23:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(896638, 101196, 23338, '<td valign="top">The plant in the foreground is too much a part of the overall image - it doesn''t feel like a frame.  More than anything, it establishes a frame of reference for the rest of the image.  I would have gotten lower and closer and had the plant take up a good portion of the bottom, left and top of the image.  Or at least I would have tried to do so.  If it didn''t work, I would have looked for something else.  Nice location, subject matter and focus.   Good luck.</td>', 'The plant in the foreground is too much a part of the overall image - it doesn''t feel like a frame.  More than anything, it establishes a frame of reference for the rest of the image.  I would have gotten lower and closer and had the plant take up a good portion of the bottom, left and top of the image.  Or at least I would have tried to do so.  If it didn''t work, I would have looked for something else.  Nice location, subject matter and focus.   Good luck.', '2004-09-07 00:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(896641, 101007, 23338, '<td valign="top">Okay, the framing is there, but the overall image is way too soft for my liking.  Maybe it looks better in print or on a different monitor, but I just had problems seeing it.  I understand the mist idea, and it looks nice on the far trees, but the fountain and the closer bushes just seem out of focus - not misty.  Maybe I''m wrong, but those are my thoughts at the moment.  Good luck.</td>', 'Okay, the framing is there, but the overall image is way too soft for my liking.  Maybe it looks better in print or on a different monitor, but I just had problems seeing it.  I understand the mist idea, and it looks nice on the far trees, but the fountain and the closer bushes just seem out of focus - not misty.  Maybe I''m wrong, but those are my thoughts at the moment.  Good luck.', '2004-09-07 00:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(896646, 101807, 23338, '<td valign="top">Really nice image, great light and wonderful clouds.  Nice contrasts.  But, as for framing, does a line of trees along the bottom of the image constitute a frame?  My thought was "No", but I could be wrong.  It does establish a very nice "frame of reference" though.  Good luck.</td>', 'Really nice image, great light and wonderful clouds.  Nice contrasts.  But, as for framing, does a line of trees along the bottom of the image constitute a frame?  My thought was "No", but I could be wrong.  It does establish a very nice "frame of reference" though.  Good luck.', '2004-09-07 00:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(896648, 101275, 23338, '<td valign="top">There were several very nice images of mountains and clouds, with the closer, darker, foreground mountains obviously being what the photographers meant to be "frames".   However, in my own humble opinion, they are so much a part of the image that they aren''t frames, but rather points of reference in the actual image.  This is a perfect example.  Like the image.  Don''t see a frame.  Good luck, though.</td>', 'There were several very nice images of mountains and clouds, with the closer, darker, foreground mountains obviously being what the photographers meant to be "frames".   However, in my own humble opinion, they are so much a part of the image that they aren''t frames, but rather points of reference in the actual image.  This is a perfect example.  Like the image.  Don''t see a frame.  Good luck, though.', '2004-09-07 00:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(896654, 101851, 25309, '<td valign="top">the front subject is too dark IMHO, but it''s a nice composition</td>', 'the front subject is too dark IMHO, but it''s a nice composition', '2004-09-07 00:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(896655, 101930, 23338, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image; nice thought; cutsey title.  Framing though?  Hmm...  The hands are so much a part of the bars image-wise, that what I see is ALL frame and no image.   Maybe if there was some kind of background indicative of a gulag or penal camp, maybe then it would have a foreground frame and background image and seem to qualify more for this challenge.  That''s just my humble opinion, and I could be wrong.  Again, nice image.  I really like the subdued lighting on the hands.</td>', 'Wonderful image; nice thought; cutsey title.  Framing though?  Hmm...  The hands are so much a part of the bars image-wise, that what I see is ALL frame and no image.   Maybe if there was some kind of background indicative of a gulag or penal camp, maybe then it would have a foreground frame and background image and seem to qualify more for this challenge.  That''s just my humble opinion, and I could be wrong.  Again, nice image.  I really like the subdued lighting on the hands.', '2004-09-07 00:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(896657, 101741, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great scenic - shot a very similar image in Yosemite yesterday!  Super colors in a very nice composition.</td>', 'Great scenic - shot a very similar image in Yosemite yesterday!  Super colors in a very nice composition.', '2004-09-07 00:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(896660, 101813, 23338, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  Contrasts galore, between the squares and the circles, the darks and the lights - so much to look at.  Your eyes never seem to stop: the people are only partly there and moving, there are reflections in the windows, there''s a foreground a background and an "around the corner" to think about.  The detail is really nice.  It''s a fun image to examine.  Oh, yeah - and there is a frame!  Congratulations.</td>', 'I love this image.  Contrasts galore, between the squares and the circles, the darks and the lights - so much to look at.  Your eyes never seem to stop: the people are only partly there and moving, there are reflections in the windows, there''s a foreground a background and an "around the corner" to think about.  The detail is really nice.  It''s a fun image to examine.  Oh, yeah - and there is a frame!  Congratulations.', '2004-09-07 00:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(896666, 101675, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is such a wonderful image - very worthy of a 10, even with many other subject matter challenges.  It really is what I think of when I think of B&amp;W photography as "fine art".   Dark framing, historic architecture, modern activities, and a little child playing - oblivious to the sinister side of the world we live in.  Congratulations.  It''s now one of my "favorites".</td>', 'This is such a wonderful image - very worthy of a 10, even with many other subject matter challenges.  It really is what I think of when I think of B&W photography as "fine art".   Dark framing, historic architecture, modern activities, and a little child playing - oblivious to the sinister side of the world we live in.  Congratulations.  It''s now one of my "favorites".', '2004-09-07 00:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(896669, 100792, 23338, '<td valign="top">So cool.  Can''t wait to hear the story behind its creation.  Really nice use of framing, contrasts, black and whites, and sure to be a family heirloom in future generations of the young subject''s family.  Congratulations.</td>', 'So cool.  Can''t wait to hear the story behind its creation.  Really nice use of framing, contrasts, black and whites, and sure to be a family heirloom in future generations of the young subject''s family.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-07 00:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(896671, 101914, 23338, '<td valign="top">Such neat contrasts and, in spite of the separation of here and there by framing, the pipe serves to bridge the gap.  Lots of shadow details, different perception levels, it''s just a wonderful image.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Such neat contrasts and, in spite of the separation of here and there by framing, the pipe serves to bridge the gap.  Lots of shadow details, different perception levels, it''s just a wonderful image.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-07 00:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(896679, 101358, 23338, '<td valign="top">Such wonderful and contrasting lines all in one image.   A round frame with detail, contrasting with lighter arcs and straight lines in the Susandiane.  They all complement each other so well and are composed so nicely.  It was a favorite of mine the very first time I went through this massive set of contributions.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Such wonderful and contrasting lines all in one image.   A round frame with detail, contrasting with lighter arcs and straight lines in the Susandiane.  They all complement each other so well and are composed so nicely.  It was a favorite of mine the very first time I went through this massive set of contributions.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-07 00:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(896687, 100518, 19608, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo.  Perfect exposure (pun intended!)  Nice composition.  Great idea.</td>', 'Woo hoo.  Perfect exposure (pun intended!)  Nice composition.  Great idea.', '2004-09-07 00:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(896723, 100814, 23338, '<td valign="top">Reminds me so much of a life-size terrarium - a little mystical world of green in which you can imagine so much.  The framing works even without any detail - the little piece of wood across the base provides that.   The contrasts between the dark branches, the light background, the major uprights - it all just works so well.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Reminds me so much of a life-size terrarium - a little mystical world of green in which you can imagine so much.  The framing works even without any detail - the little piece of wood across the base provides that.   The contrasts between the dark branches, the light background, the major uprights - it all just works so well.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-07 00:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(896730, 101723, 23338, '<td valign="top">Frames on many levels, and such neat contrasts of dark and light.   I love it.   I could have wished for a little more focus on the closest planes, but, Hey!  You can''t have everything.  Nice image.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Frames on many levels, and such neat contrasts of dark and light.   I love it.   I could have wished for a little more focus on the closest planes, but, Hey!  You can''t have everything.  Nice image.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-07 01:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(896732, 101675, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent B&amp;W.  Great whites/blacks and tonal range.  Tells a good story and it''s also framed very well.</td>', 'Excellent B&W.  Great whites/blacks and tonal range.  Tells a good story and it''s also framed very well.', '2004-09-07 01:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(896733, 101933, 18686, '<td valign="top">Well done..very evocative, well titled, and still adhering to the topic.</td>', 'Well done..very evocative, well titled, and still adhering to the topic.', '2004-09-07 01:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(896735, 101814, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.  Crooked horizon, no framing.</td>', 'Nice silhouette.  Crooked horizon, no framing.', '2004-09-07 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(896738, 101817, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  It''s a high score but would be another point or two if the exposure was under what it is now.</td>', 'Very well done.  It''s a high score but would be another point or two if the exposure was under what it is now.', '2004-09-07 01:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(896750, 100082, 23338, '<td valign="top">This image really grows on you.  Every time I view it, I rate it higher.</td>', 'This image really grows on you.  Every time I view it, I rate it higher.', '2004-09-07 01:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(896757, 101817, 8891, '<td valign="top">I am fascinated by the circumstances of this shot. Great find. The surrounding wood appears a bit overexposed to me, but it is so different from everything else I''ve seen, I''ll let that go.  Good luck!</td>', 'I am fascinated by the circumstances of this shot. Great find. The surrounding wood appears a bit overexposed to me, but it is so different from everything else I''ve seen, I''ll let that go.  Good luck!', '2004-09-07 01:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(896760, 101775, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and a grand mounatin scenic.</td>', 'Wonderful light and a grand mounatin scenic.', '2004-09-07 01:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(896769, 101517, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful frame.  (But why did you leave the top left corner in?) Scene inside the frame is dramatic - would be even better with a more blue sky.</td>', 'Wonderful frame.  (But why did you leave the top left corner in?) Scene inside the frame is dramatic - would be even better with a more blue sky.', '2004-09-07 01:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(896771, 101643, 1827, '<td valign="top">I love the color here.  Framing and cropping are also great!<br/>eta: Would be great to clone out that one hot spot under his right ear.<br/>Still 10.  One of my top three for the week.</td>', 'I love the color here.  Framing and cropping are also great!eta: Would be great to clone out that one hot spot under his right ear.Still 10.  One of my top three for the week.', '2004-09-07 01:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(896773, 101001, 1827, '<td valign="top">LOVE it, very original. 9<br/>ETA: changed vote to ten.  Grew on me lots and lots.  One of my top three for the week.</td>', 'LOVE it, very original. 9ETA: changed vote to ten.  Grew on me lots and lots.  One of my top three for the week.', '2004-09-07 01:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(896784, 100418, 1827, '<td valign="top">Very creative; well composed.  I like the fact that the foreground is sharp but that when you look through to the eternal it''s hazy. 9</td>', 'Very creative; well composed.  I like the fact that the foreground is sharp but that when you look through to the eternal it''s hazy. 9', '2004-09-07 01:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(896788, 101933, 19608, '<td valign="top">Emotional and great seeing.  Duotone (or ?) is wonderful.  Don''t like the tilted horizon/</td>', 'Emotional and great seeing.  Duotone (or ?) is wonderful.  Don''t like the tilted horizon/', '2004-09-07 01:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(896817, 100050, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent frame - and great colors.  Now if there was something on the brightest rock.  (The framed item.)</td>', 'Excellent frame - and great colors.  Now if there was something on the brightest rock.  (The framed item.)', '2004-09-07 02:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(896821, 101520, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is one of my highest votes - even though a) I don''t think there''s much of a frame and b) The border detracts.  But the water, sky, rocks, and beach in wonderful lighting make up for the faults - and then some.</td>', 'This is one of my highest votes - even though a) I don''t think there''s much of a frame and b) The border detracts.  But the water, sky, rocks, and beach in wonderful lighting make up for the faults - and then some.', '2004-09-07 02:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(896822, 101463, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great frame taken in perfect sunset lighting.  Excellent use of aperture to hold it all in focus.</td>', 'Great frame taken in perfect sunset lighting.  Excellent use of aperture to hold it all in focus.', '2004-09-07 02:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(896824, 101291, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors - due to nice exposure.  May be stronger if the window sill was level with the base.</td>', 'Great colors - due to nice exposure.  May be stronger if the window sill was level with the base.', '2004-09-07 02:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(896825, 101850, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a different take on frames and one of my highest votes.  The bridge bothers me a bit - calling attention away from the main subject.  But yet I like the shadowed building with the sunlit one - and the diagonal line they form.</td>', 'It''s a different take on frames and one of my highest votes.  The bridge bothers me a bit - calling attention away from the main subject.  But yet I like the shadowed building with the sunlit one - and the diagonal line they form.', '2004-09-07 02:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(896826, 101501, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and great seeing of a very simple, yet effective, shot.  I would not change anything!</td>', 'Great lighting and great seeing of a very simple, yet effective, shot.  I would not change anything!', '2004-09-07 02:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(896829, 101602, 19608, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I don''t see much framing.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I don''t see much framing.', '2004-09-07 02:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(896831, 101533, 19608, '<td valign="top">A gallent effort, but I don''t see the sky is really a frame.</td>', 'A gallent effort, but I don''t see the sky is really a frame.', '2004-09-07 02:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(896832, 101001, 22781, '<td valign="top">Great idea, would have been stronger (but misunderstood I guess) without the top part... One of my top picks. (9)</td>', 'Great idea, would have been stronger (but misunderstood I guess) without the top part... One of my top picks. (9)', '2004-09-07 02:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(896833, 101866, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s artistic and appears ti have a framing element.  The lens flare and over exposed areas detract as does the border.</td>', 'It''s artistic and appears ti have a framing element.  The lens flare and over exposed areas detract as does the border.', '2004-09-07 02:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(896835, 101038, 19608, '<td valign="top">The pine framing the sky is a nice title... but it''s not that interesting for me.</td>', 'The pine framing the sky is a nice title... but it''s not that interesting for me.', '2004-09-07 02:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(896837, 101930, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nice title. Unfortunately the print is very muddy - no whites to be seen.</td>', 'Good idea, nice title. Unfortunately the print is very muddy - no whites to be seen.', '2004-09-07 02:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(896838, 101007, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely done if a little blown in the fountain.  How did you achieve your soft focus effect?<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely done if a little blown in the fountain.  How did you achieve your soft focus effect?TC', '2004-09-07 02:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(896839, 101680, 19608, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry - I don''t see what is framing anything.</td>', 'I''m sorry - I don''t see what is framing anything.', '2004-09-07 02:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(896840, 101717, 9906, '<td valign="top">Has a distinct blue tint to it which makes me think your white balance was off...  What time of day did you shoot this?  The lighting is a little harsh.<br/>TC</td>', 'Has a distinct blue tint to it which makes me think your white balance was off...  What time of day did you shoot this?  The lighting is a little harsh.TC', '2004-09-07 02:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(896841, 101593, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge - nice composition and exposure.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge - nice composition and exposure.', '2004-09-07 02:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(896843, 101809, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Great b/w treatment.  Looks like a jjbequin...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely done!  Great b/w treatment.  Looks like a jjbequin...TC', '2004-09-07 02:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(896845, 101769, 19608, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Nice seeing and nice take on the framing.  It may be stronger if you could have zoomed in to the inner-most frame.</td>', 'Funny!  Nice seeing and nice take on the framing.  It may be stronger if you could have zoomed in to the inner-most frame.', '2004-09-07 02:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(896846, 100546, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very small...  What about this is intended to meet the challenge?<br/>TC</td>', 'Very small...  What about this is intended to meet the challenge?TC', '2004-09-07 02:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(896847, 101428, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent attempt - but you just had too many f-stops to deal with.</td>', 'Excellent attempt - but you just had too many f-stops to deal with.', '2004-09-07 02:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(896848, 101675, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Love the feeling of depth given through the diffent levels and the lighting.  Perfect choice for b/w treatment!  Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Love the feeling of depth given through the diffent levels and the lighting.  Perfect choice for b/w treatment!  KudosTC', '2004-09-07 02:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(896849, 101660, 19608, '<td valign="top">I really like yur image - and have tried hard to find a frame.  If you meant to frame the sun between the legs, then zoom way in, but that would destroy the feel of the shot.</td>', 'I really like yur image - and have tried hard to find a frame.  If you meant to frame the sun between the legs, then zoom way in, but that would destroy the feel of the shot.', '2004-09-07 02:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(896851, 101870, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''ve been playing around with self portraits of this style and would never have thought of using it for thsi challenge!  Very creative!<br/>TC</td>', 'I''ve been playing around with self portraits of this style and would never have thought of using it for thsi challenge!  Very creative!TC', '2004-09-07 02:41:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(896852, 101882, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on challenge!  Almost looks oversharpened though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting take on challenge!  Almost looks oversharpened though...TC', '2004-09-07 02:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(896856, 101813, 9906, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if someone would do something like this!  It works OK in this example, but it''s too busy.  There are too many unneeded elements in the shot.  It would probably be OK if all the peds were outside (or inside) the frame...<br/>TC</td>', 'I was wondering if someone would do something like this!  It works OK in this example, but it''s too busy.  There are too many unneeded elements in the shot.  It would probably be OK if all the peds were outside (or inside) the frame...TC', '2004-09-07 02:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(896862, 101853, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and simple composition!  My only real complaint is that the planking is just a touch crooked.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very elegant and simple composition!  My only real complaint is that the planking is just a touch crooked.TC', '2004-09-07 02:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(896867, 100388, 23561, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Image is a little small and the color seems a bit flat.</td>', 'Great capture. Image is a little small and the color seems a bit flat.', '2004-09-07 02:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(896869, 101875, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m confused by the girl being upside down...  A tighter crop without all the unneeded external elements would give this more pop.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m confused by the girl being upside down...  A tighter crop without all the unneeded external elements would give this more pop.TC', '2004-09-07 03:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(896872, 101341, 9906, '<td valign="top">It''s a little overexposed and oversaturated.  With out these two issues, this might be a very beautiful scene.  With the issues, it''s not very interesting...<br/>TC</td>', 'It''s a little overexposed and oversaturated.  With out these two issues, this might be a very beautiful scene.  With the issues, it''s not very interesting...TC', '2004-09-07 03:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(896873, 100504, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure which element is supposed to be framing which element...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m not really sure which element is supposed to be framing which element...TC', '2004-09-07 03:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(896874, 101112, 9906, '<td valign="top">Clone out the ugly brown smudge on the wall and crop in a touch closer to get rid of the hanging basket and this would be a VERY nice shot!  Oh yeah, your a little crooked too.  This is a simple fix in PS...  PM me after challenge if you need help with this<br/>TC</td>', 'Clone out the ugly brown smudge on the wall and crop in a touch closer to get rid of the hanging basket and this would be a VERY nice shot!  Oh yeah, your a little crooked too.  This is a simple fix in PS...  PM me after challenge if you need help with thisTC', '2004-09-07 03:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(896878, 100792, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is incredibly well done and took much patience from a very young model (and photographer I shoud add)!  I hope she was well rewarded.  Best in show that I''ve seen so far.  KUDOS.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is incredibly well done and took much patience from a very young model (and photographer I shoud add)!  I hope she was well rewarded.  Best in show that I''ve seen so far.  KUDOS.TC', '2004-09-07 03:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(896880, 101596, 9906, '<td valign="top">The ever slightest amount of fill lighting on the fence and this would be perfect!  (I have my own lighting issues and can''t help with this one, but it would make a great subject for a forum thread.  You could get the opinions of the lighting gurus!)<br/>TC</td>', 'The ever slightest amount of fill lighting on the fence and this would be perfect!  (I have my own lighting issues and can''t help with this one, but it would make a great subject for a forum thread.  You could get the opinions of the lighting gurus!)TC', '2004-09-07 03:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(896881, 101826, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love how the eyes match the foliage!  Are you blown out on the highlights or did you neatimage?<br/>TC</td>', 'Love how the eyes match the foliage!  Are you blown out on the highlights or did you neatimage?TC', '2004-09-07 03:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(896888, 101634, 9906, '<td valign="top">I need to call my buddy on my cell phone and see if he knows what those boxes on the wall are...  Just kidding, is this a self portrait or a candid?  Other than being a little soft its a very nice shot!  Were you in a moving vehicle when you took this or is the framing a platform of some sort?<br/>TC</td>', 'I need to call my buddy on my cell phone and see if he knows what those boxes on the wall are...  Just kidding, is this a self portrait or a candid?  Other than being a little soft its a very nice shot!  Were you in a moving vehicle when you took this or is the framing a platform of some sort?TC', '2004-09-07 03:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(896901, 101788, 23891, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, however the oversharpening makes it look harsh and loses something IMHO.</td>', 'Beautiful, however the oversharpening makes it look harsh and loses something IMHO.', '2004-09-07 03:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
