(897615, 101001, 18913, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped the sky to complete the illusion but you''re right on in regards to what the challenge calls for.  Well done!  Imaginative and neat.</td>', 'I''d have cropped the sky to complete the illusion but you''re right on in regards to what the challenge calls for.  Well done!  Imaginative and neat.', '2004-09-07 16:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(897619, 100830, 18913, '<td valign="top">Ambitious but busy.</td>', 'Ambitious but busy.', '2004-09-07 16:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(897622, 101856, 18913, '<td valign="top">Hell of a moon shot.</td>', 'Hell of a moon shot.', '2004-09-07 16:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(897623, 100777, 18913, '<td valign="top">Fun! I like it.</td>', 'Fun! I like it.', '2004-09-07 16:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(897627, 101813, 18913, '<td valign="top">Nice one....symmetry too.</td>', 'Nice one....symmetry too.', '2004-09-07 16:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(897629, 101854, 24925, '<td valign="top">"Is this framed?"  That will be the question others might ask, to which I reply "Yes, yes it is...and it''s a pretty good photo, too!  Except for that distracting stuff in the top left corner...a tighter crop might''ve been more appropriate."<br/> <br/></td>', '"Is this framed?"  That will be the question others might ask, to which I reply "Yes, yes it is...and it''s a pretty good photo, too!  Except for that distracting stuff in the top left corner...a tighter crop might''ve been more appropriate." ', '2004-09-07 16:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(897632, 101679, 18913, '<td valign="top">Potentially great image but it lacks sharpness and definition in the foreground.</td>', 'Potentially great image but it lacks sharpness and definition in the foreground.', '2004-09-07 16:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(897633, 101513, 18913, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the interior could use some ambient light.</td>', 'Interesting, but the interior could use some ambient light.', '2004-09-07 16:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(897635, 101291, 18913, '<td valign="top">Intriguing as the challenge promises.</td>', 'Intriguing as the challenge promises.', '2004-09-07 16:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(897638, 101847, 23338, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that others will vote this lower than I do - mainly because of the out of focus plant life in the background and the lack of definition on the fence wire in the foreground.  Never-the-less, those eyes, those little pin feathers all around the face, the exquisite detail ...  you gotta love it.  And, although it has a hint of tone to it, I love black and whites - or single color and white images.</td>', 'I''m sure that others will vote this lower than I do - mainly because of the out of focus plant life in the background and the lack of definition on the fence wire in the foreground.  Never-the-less, those eyes, those little pin feathers all around the face, the exquisite detail ...  you gotta love it.  And, although it has a hint of tone to it, I love black and whites - or single color and white images.', '2004-09-07 16:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(897639, 100418, 18913, '<td valign="top">Good one.</td>', 'Good one.', '2004-09-07 16:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(897641, 101870, 24925, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this will score well on this site...my instinct tells me ''No'' but my index finger gives you an 8 so I hope that helps!</td>', 'I wonder if this will score well on this site...my instinct tells me ''No'' but my index finger gives you an 8 so I hope that helps!', '2004-09-07 16:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(897643, 101810, 18913, '<td valign="top">Great light on your hand.</td>', 'Great light on your hand.', '2004-09-07 16:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(897646, 101916, 23338, '<td valign="top">I keep telling myself, "You''re not a voyeur, you''re not a ...", but I really hope this system doesn''t keep track of how many times I personally clicked on this image as I was passing by.  It has a "soft" feel to it that is appropriate for the subject matter and the position of the model compliments the shape of the window.  Nice photo.</td>', 'I keep telling myself, "You''re not a voyeur, you''re not a ...", but I really hope this system doesn''t keep track of how many times I personally clicked on this image as I was passing by.  It has a "soft" feel to it that is appropriate for the subject matter and the position of the model compliments the shape of the window.  Nice photo.', '2004-09-07 17:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(897647, 101914, 24925, '<td valign="top">I know others might have mentioned it, but I would prefer this photo without the pipe...and with somebody on the bench on the top floor.<br/> <br/>I would love to see outtakes of this if you have any, but this is a great photo as well!</td>', 'I know others might have mentioned it, but I would prefer this photo without the pipe...and with somebody on the bench on the top floor. I would love to see outtakes of this if you have any, but this is a great photo as well!', '2004-09-07 17:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(897648, 100815, 18913, '<td valign="top">You''re reaching but it is very emotive.</td>', 'You''re reaching but it is very emotive.', '2004-09-07 17:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(897650, 100667, 23338, '<td valign="top">I always like images that are lit with light from within.  This one is a good example, and the swirling smoke and scattering embers add to the mood.  Nice image.</td>', 'I always like images that are lit with light from within.  This one is a good example, and the swirling smoke and scattering embers add to the mood.  Nice image.', '2004-09-07 17:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(897652, 101800, 15113, '<td valign="top">nice idea, composition. I would have liked to see a bit more of the right hand. Its kinda got distracted with too much light</td>', 'nice idea, composition. I would have liked to see a bit more of the right hand. Its kinda got distracted with too much light', '2004-09-07 17:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(897654, 100792, 24925, '<td valign="top">Really really good, but it''s a very loose interpretation of...screw it, that''s what everyone else will be complaining about so I''ll just give you the 8 I really want to give you!</td>', 'Really really good, but it''s a very loose interpretation of...screw it, that''s what everyone else will be complaining about so I''ll just give you the 8 I really want to give you!', '2004-09-07 17:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(897656, 101657, 15113, '<td valign="top">like the light in this.</td>', 'like the light in this.', '2004-09-07 17:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(897658, 100830, 15113, '<td valign="top">nice idea. But seems a bit off focus to me</td>', 'nice idea. But seems a bit off focus to me', '2004-09-07 17:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(897659, 101823, 23338, '<td valign="top">The subject matter framed, takes over the framing matter and thus becomes almost secondary matter which is out of focus.  Very interesting perspective and nicely done.  I liked it very much.</td>', 'The subject matter framed, takes over the framing matter and thus becomes almost secondary matter which is out of focus.  Very interesting perspective and nicely done.  I liked it very much.', '2004-09-07 17:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(897660, 101814, 24925, '<td valign="top">This pose looks a little too awkward...</td>', 'This pose looks a little too awkward...', '2004-09-07 17:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(897661, 100397, 18913, '<td valign="top">Shame about the too tight crop but this is exactly what the challenge calls for.</td>', 'Shame about the too tight crop but this is exactly what the challenge calls for.', '2004-09-07 17:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(897662, 101810, 15113, '<td valign="top">surprised that u got good lighting on a plane !</td>', 'surprised that u got good lighting on a plane !', '2004-09-07 17:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(897663, 101723, 24925, '<td valign="top">This is really good!  There would have been so many ways to capture this in a much less pleasing manner and you seemed to avoid all of those ways!<br/> <br/>Good work!</td>', 'This is really good!  There would have been so many ways to capture this in a much less pleasing manner and you seemed to avoid all of those ways! Good work!', '2004-09-07 17:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(897664, 101693, 15113, '<td valign="top">one of my fav.  excellent idea and well taken. good focus</td>', 'one of my fav.  excellent idea and well taken. good focus', '2004-09-07 17:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(897666, 101360, 15113, '<td valign="top">not sure how this fits the challenge. Also seems to be very high contrast</td>', 'not sure how this fits the challenge. Also seems to be very high contrast', '2004-09-07 17:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(897667, 100723, 15113, '<td valign="top">nice pic. maybe it could have been a bit darker?</td>', 'nice pic. maybe it could have been a bit darker?', '2004-09-07 17:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(897671, 100852, 18913, '<td valign="top">This is the winner for me.  The foreground holds your interest as does the subject matter in the background.  This challenge calls for juxtaposition and you have achieved this beautifully, curiously and majestically.</td>', 'This is the winner for me.  The foreground holds your interest as does the subject matter in the background.  This challenge calls for juxtaposition and you have achieved this beautifully, curiously and majestically.', '2004-09-07 17:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(897677, 101924, 24925, '<td valign="top">This sunset looks very unnatural to me...</td>', 'This sunset looks very unnatural to me...', '2004-09-07 17:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(897683, 101496, 23338, '<td valign="top">This kept grabbing me and I couldn''t figure out why.  After I studied it for awhile, I suddenly realized that the subject matter behind the frame becomes almost secondary in nature, except for the perspective lines set up by the bricks, rails and sidewalks.  With them tied into it, the subject matter is the overpowering shape and colors of the frame itself.  The clarity (focus) and contrasting black above the arches with the red wood frames themselves combine to draw you into what is behind them - even though what is behind them is not all that interesting without them.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This kept grabbing me and I couldn''t figure out why.  After I studied it for awhile, I suddenly realized that the subject matter behind the frame becomes almost secondary in nature, except for the perspective lines set up by the bricks, rails and sidewalks.  With them tied into it, the subject matter is the overpowering shape and colors of the frame itself.  The clarity (focus) and contrasting black above the arches with the red wood frames themselves combine to draw you into what is behind them - even though what is behind them is not all that interesting without them.  Nicely done.', '2004-09-07 17:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(897685, 101800, 24925, '<td valign="top">Several others did the finger-frame thingy and I scored most of them very low, but you did a great job and brought life and feeling to the shot...<br/> <br/>Great work!</td>', 'Several others did the finger-frame thingy and I scored most of them very low, but you did a great job and brought life and feeling to the shot... Great work!', '2004-09-07 17:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(897690, 101719, 23338, '<td valign="top">Oh, man!  What is it about these small, European-type streets that make them so attractive?  I love the dark framing, the feeling of looking "into" a smaller picture within the larger framework, the detail in the bricks, the walls, the lights and the roof tiles.  The contrast of the light pastel colors and the dark black foreground walls works very well also.  Nice image.</td>', 'Oh, man!  What is it about these small, European-type streets that make them so attractive?  I love the dark framing, the feeling of looking "into" a smaller picture within the larger framework, the detail in the bricks, the walls, the lights and the roof tiles.  The contrast of the light pastel colors and the dark black foreground walls works very well also.  Nice image.', '2004-09-07 17:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(897692, 100815, 15113, '<td valign="top">good interpretation of the challenge</td>', 'good interpretation of the challenge', '2004-09-07 17:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(897693, 101659, 15113, '<td valign="top">nice idea..some more light would have been better?<br/></td>', 'nice idea..some more light would have been better?', '2004-09-07 17:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(897701, 100792, 15113, '<td valign="top">nice idea and well shot</td>', 'nice idea and well shot', '2004-09-07 17:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(897724, 101946, 19959, '<td valign="top">I like this... this is a good take on the challenge... if a little risky. Voters can be quite fussy...</td>', 'I like this... this is a good take on the challenge... if a little risky. Voters can be quite fussy...', '2004-09-07 17:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(897725, 101802, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset... good interpretation.</td>', 'Nice sunset... good interpretation.', '2004-09-07 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(897728, 101428, 19959, '<td valign="top">This would work on backlighting also :-) Very good</td>', 'This would work on backlighting also :-) Very good', '2004-09-07 17:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(897729, 101847, 25150, '<td valign="top">so crisp and detailed,<br/>sepia was a great choice for this image. One of my favorites!</td>', 'so crisp and detailed,sepia was a great choice for this image. One of my favorites!', '2004-09-07 17:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(897732, 101520, 25150, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful. I hope people don''t vote it down because they think it''s not properly framed. I think it''s a perfect example of framing!</td>', 'This is so beautiful. I hope people don''t vote it down because they think it''s not properly framed. I think it''s a perfect example of framing!', '2004-09-07 17:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
