(897762, 101517, 13487, '<td valign="top">I would suggest a tighter crop to make the subject of the photo larger or more pronounced.  Your frame is good... you just have too much of it.</td>', 'I would suggest a tighter crop to make the subject of the photo larger or more pronounced.  Your frame is good... you just have too much of it.', '2004-09-07 18:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(897763, 100550, 24454, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done.  Black and white works well with this shot.  I also really like that it is crystal clear through the whole depth of field.</td>', 'Really nicely done.  Black and white works well with this shot.  I also really like that it is crystal clear through the whole depth of field.', '2004-09-07 18:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(897774, 100388, 10263, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably heard this a lot already, but photos this small are hard to vote on. Just too small for much detail.  Also the fence in the foreground is a distraction. Looks like he was after the birds seed! :)</td>', 'You''ve probably heard this a lot already, but photos this small are hard to vote on. Just too small for much detail.  Also the fence in the foreground is a distraction. Looks like he was after the birds seed! :)', '2004-09-07 18:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(897776, 101847, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a great picture.   The black and white works great with this picture, and I think the shallow depth of field is great where just the frame and the bird stand out.</td>', 'What a great picture.   The black and white works great with this picture, and I think the shallow depth of field is great where just the frame and the bird stand out.', '2004-09-07 18:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(897777, 100504, 10263, '<td valign="top">There really isn''t anything in this that holds my attention.</td>', 'There really isn''t anything in this that holds my attention.', '2004-09-07 18:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(897778, 101820, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very nice clarity from front to back.</td>', 'Very nice clarity from front to back.', '2004-09-07 18:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(897779, 101376, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is a good fun shot</td>', 'This is a good fun shot', '2004-09-07 18:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(897780, 101784, 24454, '<td valign="top">Neat picture.  The colors almost make it look cepia.  Has a nice feel to it.</td>', 'Neat picture.  The colors almost make it look cepia.  Has a nice feel to it.', '2004-09-07 18:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(897784, 101443, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is sweet. I have one with a child framed by play equipment too and am getting the "doesn''t meet the challenge" I think they both do :) Hope you are doing better than I am.</td>', 'This is sweet. I have one with a child framed by play equipment too and am getting the "doesn''t meet the challenge" I think they both do :) Hope you are doing better than I am.', '2004-09-07 18:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(897785, 101268, 11270, '<td valign="top">The detail in the archway is stunning, a well shot photograph, a 10</td>', 'The detail in the archway is stunning, a well shot photograph, a 10', '2004-09-07 18:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(897787, 101864, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  The black and white works so well with it.  And  I like how the depth of field is crystal clear all the way from front to back.  Good job.</td>', 'I really like this picture.  The black and white works so well with it.  And  I like how the depth of field is crystal clear all the way from front to back.  Good job.', '2004-09-07 18:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(897789, 101660, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I''m imagining how hard it must have been to time this just right.  I like the silhouette too.  It gives the picture a nice feel.</td>', 'Very creative.  I''m imagining how hard it must have been to time this just right.  I like the silhouette too.  It gives the picture a nice feel.', '2004-09-07 18:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(897790, 101657, 10263, '<td valign="top">I love this one. I like the warm colors and the "frame" is perfect.</td>', 'I love this one. I like the warm colors and the "frame" is perfect.', '2004-09-07 18:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(897791, 100837, 10263, '<td valign="top">Excellent candid.</td>', 'Excellent candid.', '2004-09-07 18:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(897792, 101675, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great picture.   I love the black and white with this one.  It has a really nice feel to it.</td>', 'Great picture.   I love the black and white with this one.  It has a really nice feel to it.', '2004-09-07 18:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(897798, 101561, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  This took some waiting I''m guessing to get this one just right.  Good job.</td>', 'Great picture.  This took some waiting I''m guessing to get this one just right.  Good job.', '2004-09-07 18:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(897799, 100600, 10263, '<td valign="top">To me, the crop is a little too close. Too many parts of the child touch or go off the edge. I think if you crop a lot of her so it looks intentional, or none at all, it would work better.</td>', 'To me, the crop is a little too close. Too many parts of the child touch or go off the edge. I think if you crop a lot of her so it looks intentional, or none at all, it would work better.', '2004-09-07 18:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(897801, 100196, 24454, '<td valign="top">Perfect depiction of the challenge.  Good job.</td>', 'Perfect depiction of the challenge.  Good job.', '2004-09-07 18:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(897811, 101769, 11270, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice photograph, but find the surrounding stones distracting from the subject, I would have done a closer frame</td>', 'I think this is a nice photograph, but find the surrounding stones distracting from the subject, I would have done a closer frame', '2004-09-07 19:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(897812, 101718, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooooh. . . .neat picture.  It almost looks black and white.  Perfect for the feel of this picture.</td>', 'Oooooooh. . . .neat picture.  It almost looks black and white.  Perfect for the feel of this picture.', '2004-09-07 19:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
