(897818, 101826, 24454, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this picture.  What a great depiction of the challenge. . . and the fact that I love cats makes me love the picture eve more.  That cat looks almost 3 dimensional.  Great job.</td>', 'I LOVE this picture.  What a great depiction of the challenge. . . and the fact that I love cats makes me love the picture eve more.  That cat looks almost 3 dimensional.  Great job.', '2004-09-07 19:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
