(897820, 101387, 11270, '<td valign="top">I took a similar photograph to this, but should have put my son at the end of the tunnel like yours.</td>', 'I took a similar photograph to this, but should have put my son at the end of the tunnel like yours.', '2004-09-07 19:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
