(898208, 101024, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, but I think the framing detracts from the composition rather than enhancing it.  The tiny boat leads me to think of the vastness of nature.  I think the photo would be better if the lines ran off the page to further illustrate that feeling.  Still beautiful and ranking very high.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, but I think the framing detracts from the composition rather than enhancing it.  The tiny boat leads me to think of the vastness of nature.  I think the photo would be better if the lines ran off the page to further illustrate that feeling.  Still beautiful and ranking very high.', '2004-09-07 22:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
