(898357, 101825, 9906, '<td valign="top">Dude, we need to get you a camera with a few more million pixels.  Love the soft focus effect on the foliage, but you don''t have enough detail in the girls (main subject) to make the soft focus pop.  Awesome composition with a subtle framing that works well for me for this challenge!<br/>TC</td>', 'Dude, we need to get you a camera with a few more million pixels.  Love the soft focus effect on the foliage, but you don''t have enough detail in the girls (main subject) to make the soft focus pop.  Awesome composition with a subtle framing that works well for me for this challenge!TC', '2004-09-08 00:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
