(898387, 100644, 25224, '<td valign="top">So... um... Star Wars Fan?  The bastard''s not the grim reaper.  And while the lighting is good on him, I''m really distracted by the foreground.  That''s no Naboo.  That looks more like the stained glass from Beauty and the Beast, the Disney intro.  Infact, I''m almost willing to bet that that''s what you did.  You went to your sister''s closet and cut up one of her old disney books.  Sick... really sick...   Also, I''m not feeling the ground.  I would like the ground to be a little less obvious.  I can tell its a black sweater.  Probably warm-ups.  However, I like the photo, because, when you think about it, here''s the dark sith lord, trying to convey his sinister presence from below his hooded cloak, when, really, he''s just a tiny plastic figure waiting for Belle.</td>', 'So... um... Star Wars Fan?  The bastard''s not the grim reaper.  And while the lighting is good on him, I''m really distracted by the foreground.  That''s no Naboo.  That looks more like the stained glass from Beauty and the Beast, the Disney intro.  Infact, I''m almost willing to bet that that''s what you did.  You went to your sister''s closet and cut up one of her old disney books.  Sick... really sick...   Also, I''m not feeling the ground.  I would like the ground to be a little less obvious.  I can tell its a black sweater.  Probably warm-ups.  However, I like the photo, because, when you think about it, here''s the dark sith lord, trying to convey his sinister presence from below his hooded cloak, when, really, he''s just a tiny plastic figure waiting for Belle.', '2004-09-08 00:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(898394, 101817, 25224, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t live anywhere where you might have a fire.  Good shot.</td>', 'I hope you don''t live anywhere where you might have a fire.  Good shot.', '2004-09-08 00:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
