(898520, 101926, 21031, '<td valign="top">a shot of the Oklahoma City Bombing Memorial.well i guess i should''ve picked a different title. i know it''s hard to see, but on the monument across the pool is the time "9:03". and on the monument that i''m under is the time "9:01". the bombing took place at 9:02. so i found the title fitting, but most probably didn''t. i felt that i shouldn''t have to explain the picture with words so i tried not to spell it out. maybe should''ve taken a better photo.thanks to everyone for the comments and the votes.</td>', 'a shot of the Oklahoma City Bombing Memorial.well i guess i should''ve picked a different title. i know it''s hard to see, but on the monument across the pool is the time "9:03". and on the monument that i''m under is the time "9:01". the bombing took place at 9:02. so i found the title fitting, but most probably didn''t. i felt that i shouldn''t have to explain the picture with words so i tried not to spell it out. maybe should''ve taken a better photo.thanks to everyone for the comments and the votes.', '2004-09-08 01:08:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(898522, 100792, 19982, '<td valign="top">Oh, did I say down below I was betting on a top 5 finish?  I *knew* I should have said top 4.  Congratulations!!!</td>', 'Oh, did I say down below I was betting on a top 5 finish?  I *knew* I should have said top 4.  Congratulations!!!', '2004-09-08 01:09:36.000000', NULL, 0),
