(899242, 100397, 16907, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ivash:</b></div><hr/><i>I must say - I''ve had lower expectations for this one.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>O yea... why lower expectations? Mainly because this particular picture (that ribboned) in a way, is not an original. Basically, I haven''t taken this shot because of the title of the challenge, I kind of recycled it.<br/> <br/>I know the title ''Framed'' is a bit obvious, but that was the name of the original and I decided to go with it.<br/> <br/>PS<br/>Sorry about my English skills, still thinking in Croatian :)</td>', 'Originally posted by ivash:I must say - I''ve had lower expectations for this one. O yea... why lower expectations? Mainly because this particular picture (that ribboned) in a way, is not an original. Basically, I haven''t taken this shot because of the title of the challenge, I kind of recycled it. I know the title ''Framed'' is a bit obvious, but that was the name of the original and I decided to go with it. PSSorry about my English skills, still thinking in Croatian :)', '2004-09-08 05:09:11.000000', NULL, 0),
