(900004, 101683, 25095, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lawree:</b></div><hr/><i> Maybe it is just me, but I don''t see the framing in this picture, otherwise it is a nice pic. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It was my understanding that the forground should frame the background, while the chairs do not make a continous frame on all four sides they do frame the sunrise.  I will try harder on future submissions, thanks for the input.</td>', 'Originally posted by lawree: Maybe it is just me, but I don''t see the framing in this picture, otherwise it is a nice pic.  It was my understanding that the forground should frame the background, while the chairs do not make a continous frame on all four sides they do frame the sunrise.  I will try harder on future submissions, thanks for the input.', '2004-09-08 14:42:41.000000', NULL, 0),
