(901016, 100852, 8891, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9 as it I thought it fit the challenge very well and it was a very interesting shot with excellent DOF and fine detail in the foreground subject. Super! Congrats on your finish...wish it had been higher. With regards to the shot with the rear subject in focus, I like this better and think the angle better on this with regards to the further subject...too much table in the other.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-08 22:08:24.</i></td>', 'I gave this a 9 as it I thought it fit the challenge very well and it was a very interesting shot with excellent DOF and fine detail in the foreground subject. Super! Congrats on your finish...wish it had been higher. With regards to the shot with the rear subject in focus, I like this better and think the angle better on this with regards to the further subject...too much table in the other.', '2004-09-08 23:01:23.000000', '2004-09-08 23:08:24.000000', 0),
(901169, 101851, 18505, '<td valign="top">GREAT capture!!!  I doubt that many know how difficult it is to get such clarity in the lovely humidity which usually envelopes this campus.  Wish I had made it through all the submissions for this challenge.  You would have received a "10" from me.  Brings back many happy memories of my years at Mizzou.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'GREAT capture!!!  I doubt that many know how difficult it is to get such clarity in the lovely humidity which usually envelopes this campus.  Wish I had made it through all the submissions for this challenge.  You would have received a "10" from me.  Brings back many happy memories of my years at Mizzou.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-09-09 00:06:14.000000', NULL, 0),
