(901374, 101615, 25899, '<td valign="top">Really wished the people who gave me 2s and 3s commented because I thought it was an ok shot with a little mystique to it but maybe the paintings on the bridge pillar looked a little too "unreal"?</td>', 'Really wished the people who gave me 2s and 3s commented because I thought it was an ok shot with a little mystique to it but maybe the paintings on the bridge pillar looked a little too "unreal"?', '2004-09-09 02:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
