(901520, 100723, 14535, '<td valign="top">I realized only after i posted and comments started coming in that all this rucus about flatnees is because I have a laptop and the colours etc are really different from a plain old monitor even after caliibration using adobe gamma. I will take care next time. Thanks for all ur comments.</td>', 'I realized only after i posted and comments started coming in that all this rucus about flatnees is because I have a laptop and the colours etc are really different from a plain old monitor even after caliibration using adobe gamma. I will take care next time. Thanks for all ur comments.', '2004-09-09 06:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
