(901564, 101813, 24128, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments :)<br/> <br/>I''m really happy with the pic and feel that I captured more or less exactly what I wanted. I appreciated that it would not be to everyone''s tastes on dpc, but i don''t mind :)<br/> <br/>Darren</td>', 'Thanks for the comments :) I''m really happy with the pic and feel that I captured more or less exactly what I wanted. I appreciated that it would not be to everyone''s tastes on dpc, but i don''t mind :) Darren', '2004-09-09 08:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(901567, 101813, 7560, '<td valign="top">My chief concern with this image is that it''s just too busy. You had a great idea, and it was perfect for the challenge. The problem was the conflicting elements that draw you away from the focus of the shot. The second bike outside the frame is distracting. Additionally the cutoff legs at the top of the frame don''t add much, and in many ways distract me from the bike. <br/> <br/>Waiting just a few minutes more until a body was in the frame with the bike could have made this far stronger. Still great timing on the overall capture.</td>', 'My chief concern with this image is that it''s just too busy. You had a great idea, and it was perfect for the challenge. The problem was the conflicting elements that draw you away from the focus of the shot. The second bike outside the frame is distracting. Additionally the cutoff legs at the top of the frame don''t add much, and in many ways distract me from the bike.  Waiting just a few minutes more until a body was in the frame with the bike could have made this far stronger. Still great timing on the overall capture.', '2004-09-09 08:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(901574, 101495, 17245, '<td valign="top">Thanks for comments and votes ! I was realy surprised when I checked the result. I knew it was a good pic, but not among the ten best.<br/>This realy inspires me to keep on trying.</td>', 'Thanks for comments and votes ! I was realy surprised when I checked the result. I knew it was a good pic, but not among the ten best.This realy inspires me to keep on trying.', '2004-09-09 08:33:38.000000', NULL, 0),
