(901701, 101268, 4226, '<td valign="top">thanks Tom, I really like this place, the colors are wonderful. I had taken some shots before, but during the day and the colors are washed out. So I got up at 6:00am this time and drove down 15miles to reach there before sunrise to capture the colors well and I guess they did come out well.</td>', 'thanks Tom, I really like this place, the colors are wonderful. I had taken some shots before, but during the day and the colors are washed out. So I got up at 6:00am this time and drove down 15miles to reach there before sunrise to capture the colors well and I guess they did come out well.', '2004-09-09 11:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(901795, 101847, 16636, '<td valign="top">best of the bunch in my opinion - well done</td>', 'best of the bunch in my opinion - well done', '2004-09-09 12:51:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(901877, 101520, 8860, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is tangible - a worthy winner. One of very few shots I can think of on this site where the light has such a strong role to play. There''s a shot of Sydney Bridge in my favourites that has a similarly impactful vibe.</td>', 'The lighting here is tangible - a worthy winner. One of very few shots I can think of on this site where the light has such a strong role to play. There''s a shot of Sydney Bridge in my favourites that has a similarly impactful vibe.', '2004-09-09 14:03:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(901882, 101847, 17937, '<td valign="top">Great photo. This one stuck out to me right from the start.</td>', 'Great photo. This one stuck out to me right from the start.', '2004-09-09 14:09:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(902118, 101024, 25590, '<td valign="top">Im surprised this was not at least a top ten- amazing shot--great job</td>', 'Im surprised this was not at least a top ten- amazing shot--great job', '2004-09-09 17:37:35.000000', NULL, 0);
