(908416, 101001, 26464, '<td valign="top">awesome concept! i don''t care for the shadow inside the tv frame too much, detracts from the effect a bit. but i''m glad you left the sky in, it defines the point of the photo in my opinion. excellent idea, well done! <br/></td>', 'awesome concept! i don''t care for the shadow inside the tv frame too much, detracts from the effect a bit. but i''m glad you left the sky in, it defines the point of the photo in my opinion. excellent idea, well done! ', '2004-09-13 22:05:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(908586, 101847, 1143, '<td valign="top">Obscure? I LOVE that song! I''ve been singing it for years, and they just recently started playing it on the local radio stations.<br/> <br/>Cute bird too. Looks a little oversharpened maybe(?)<br/> <br/>(but not a green dress, that''s just cruel)</td>', 'Obscure? I LOVE that song! I''ve been singing it for years, and they just recently started playing it on the local radio stations. Cute bird too. Looks a little oversharpened maybe(?) (but not a green dress, that''s just cruel)', '2004-09-13 23:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
