(913871, 101905, 24896, '<td valign="top">I seen this pic only had one comment so I thought I would add to it.<br/>It has a really unique feeling to it. For lack of better words almost stalkerish.  Its a fairly sharp image and fit the challenge well.  I wonder how it would look if it was pulled back a little with more focus on the path coming over the hill.  With a different title like "waiting" or "the unsuspecting" probable not what you were thinking...maybe I said too much....I''ll just go now...Nice photo anyway.<br/></td>', 'I seen this pic only had one comment so I thought I would add to it.It has a really unique feeling to it. For lack of better words almost stalkerish.  Its a fairly sharp image and fit the challenge well.  I wonder how it would look if it was pulled back a little with more focus on the path coming over the hill.  With a different title like "waiting" or "the unsuspecting" probable not what you were thinking...maybe I said too much....I''ll just go now...Nice photo anyway.', '2004-09-16 23:28:08.000000', NULL, 0),
