(959562, 100792, 12253, '<td valign="top">Eric, great shot!<br/> <br/>Now, here''s the challenge for you.  You will cherish this if you do it.  Every year, take one of these with her holding LAST YEAR''s pic.  Do that for the next 10 years until she''s fully matured.  It will indeed be precious.  (I did this with a video my daughter''s first 5 or so years, kept shooting video of her on the same couch, you can see her develop in real time.  A photo like this would be even more awesome!<br/> <br/>Catch them while they''re young!</td>', 'Eric, great shot! Now, here''s the challenge for you.  You will cherish this if you do it.  Every year, take one of these with her holding LAST YEAR''s pic.  Do that for the next 10 years until she''s fully matured.  It will indeed be precious.  (I did this with a video my daughter''s first 5 or so years, kept shooting video of her on the same couch, you can see her develop in real time.  A photo like this would be even more awesome! Catch them while they''re young!', '2004-10-14 16:20:34.000000', NULL, 0),
