(1045380, 101481, 3724, '<td valign="top">I do like this portrait.  I think Artyste was on the right track with his evaluation of the picture. Of course with situations like this the element of time is critical but placement in the tunnel could have been tweeked. I would have possibly liked a turn in the tunnel behind the child to eliminate the green.  A great expression and really good album picture.</td>', 'I do like this portrait.  I think Artyste was on the right track with his evaluation of the picture. Of course with situations like this the element of time is critical but placement in the tunnel could have been tweeked. I would have possibly liked a turn in the tunnel behind the child to eliminate the green.  A great expression and really good album picture.', '2004-12-03 22:04:09.000000', NULL, 0),
