(1095863, 101683, 12332, '<td valign="top">If you wanted to see the chairs more, but not fully, you could set up your flash to go off in synch mode, and dial down the flash strength a stop or two.  The bright star or planet in the upper right seems to show some elongation to the 1 o''clock, and maybe the sun does, too.  If so, that''s weird to see on a 1/1000 shutter speed.  I like sunset/sunrises, and overall, this is a very nice one, and a creative solution to the Framing challenge.</td>', 'If you wanted to see the chairs more, but not fully, you could set up your flash to go off in synch mode, and dial down the flash strength a stop or two.  The bright star or planet in the upper right seems to show some elongation to the 1 o''clock, and maybe the sun does, too.  If so, that''s weird to see on a 1/1000 shutter speed.  I like sunset/sunrises, and overall, this is a very nice one, and a creative solution to the Framing challenge.', '2005-01-07 13:20:11.000000', NULL, 0),
