(1183162, 100998, 14986, '<td valign="top">I thought I had already commented on this one because I remember seeing it before.   Just awesome, rich colors and nice exposure here.  I love the reflections and the sillouhette.  I like that, even though it fit that challenge perfectly and the framing certainly adds to the shot, it''s a photo that stand well on its own outside of the challenge too.  The only thing I would change is a slight counter clockwise rotation to straighten the horizon.   Leave everything else as is!  Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I thought I had already commented on this one because I remember seeing it before.   Just awesome, rich colors and nice exposure here.  I love the reflections and the sillouhette.  I like that, even though it fit that challenge perfectly and the framing certainly adds to the shot, it''s a photo that stand well on its own outside of the challenge too.  The only thing I would change is a slight counter clockwise rotation to straighten the horizon.   Leave everything else as is!  Hope this is helpful.', '2005-02-19 23:13:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1204994, 101520, 32774, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, you really know the spots in that area.  Good work</td>', 'Love this shot, you really know the spots in that area.  Good work', '2005-03-03 04:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
