(1270790, 101903, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a great deal - it''s all about opposites:  green glass and pink shirt; cold drinks and warm skin; hard lines and soft curves; etc etc etc.<br/> <br/>It may have its problems with focus, and the color may be off a bit, but damnit this is an intriguing photo.  I think my favorite part is the fingers...yeah, the fingers.  The cleavage is certainly evocative, but the fingers are much more interesting and surely more sensuous.</td>', 'I like this photo a great deal - it''s all about opposites:  green glass and pink shirt; cold drinks and warm skin; hard lines and soft curves; etc etc etc. It may have its problems with focus, and the color may be off a bit, but damnit this is an intriguing photo.  I think my favorite part is the fingers...yeah, the fingers.  The cleavage is certainly evocative, but the fingers are much more interesting and surely more sensuous.', '2005-04-04 17:29:28.000000', NULL, 0),
